WEBVTT

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:52.200
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: President, the presiding officer, and senator-judges of the impeachment court.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:34.030
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: The sergeant at arms is directed to make a proclamation.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:48.950
Alfredo Sotto Corpuz: All persons are commanded to keep silent under pain of penalty while the impeachment court is in session for the trial of Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:10:34.060
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: The impeachment trial of Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte is hereby called to order. Let's bow our heads and pray. Heavenly Father, we thank you for the gift of another day and another opportunity to do your will. We gather in this August Chamber to fulfill our constitutional duties as senator-judges and serve the people from whom we owe our mandate. Lend us your wisdom. Keep us from acting out of self-interest and set our sights only on the pursuit of justice. The strengthening of our democratic institutions and the creation of good governance for future generations.

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:50.690
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Buksan mo ang aming isip, puso at diwa sa katotohanan. Gawian mo kami na ipagtanggol namin ang batas at higit sa lahat kung ano ang tama. This we pray in your holy name. Amen.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.570
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: The Clerk of Court will now call the roll.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:25.970
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Trial suspended.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:39.390
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Clerk of Court will now call the roll.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.400
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: Roll call up members, Sen. Judge Aquino, Sen.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:12:23.930
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: Judge Cayetano Alan, Sen. Judge Cayetano Pia, Sen. Judge De La Rosa, Sen. Judge Ejercito, Sen. Judge Estrada, Sen. Judge Go, Sen. Judge Hontiveros, Sen. Judge Lacson, Sen. Judge Lapid, Sen. Judge Legarda, Sen. Judge Marcoleta, Sen. Judge Marcos, Sen. Judge Padilla, Sen. Judge Pangilinan, Sen. Judge Sotto III. Senator Judge Tulfo Erwin, Senator Judge Tulfo Raffy, Senator Judge Villanueva, Senator Judge Villar Camille, Senator Judge Villar Mark, Senator Judge Zubiri, The Presiding Officer Senator Judge Escudero, The Senate President Senator Judge Gatchalian.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:37.360
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: With 13 Senator Judges present, the Chair declares the presence of a quorum. In accordance with the Rules of Procedure on Impeachment Trials, the Chair now recognizes the newly elected Presiding Officer to preside over the proceedings of the Impeachment Court.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:53.500
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Mr. Senate President. If there are no objections, we shall dispense with the reading of the November 19, 2026 Journal of the Senate, sitting as an impeachment court, and consider the same. That's approved. The clerk will please call the case before the impeachment court.

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:59.740
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: Case number 004-2026, in the matter of impeachment trial of Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte.

