Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Appearances.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.840
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Good morning, Your Honors. For the prosecution, we are ready.

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:08.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Good morning, Honorable Ridon. For the respondent.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.600
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: Good morning, your honors. Same appearance for the respondent accused.

