Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Who will handle the next witness, Dr. Rodolfo Atty. Sheila?

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.940
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: It will be Atty. Justin Nicol Gular, your honor.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.860
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Justin, on the part of the prosecution?

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:24.400
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Atty. Matib, your honor.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:28.270
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Atty.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.260
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Atty. Erwin Matib, your honor.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Erwin.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Atty. Justin, good morning. Call your witness.

