Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, your honor. Good morning. For our next witness, your honor. May we call to the witness stand Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo, Your Honor.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:53.780
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly situate Mr. Rodolfo to the witness stand. Clerk is directed to administer the oath as soon as he is so situated.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:44.680
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: While he is on his way to the witness stand, Chair would like to place on record in relation to the testimony of the witness yesterday. For the information once again of the parties, the senator judges, and the public. that the AMLC records offered and admitted by the court together with the other exhibits were classified under the order of this court on November 6, 2026 and the AMLC records are classified as sealed and under supervised access for senator judges, the parties, and authorized individuals only for the information and guidance of all concerned. Clerk may proceed with administering the oath.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:15:00.760
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: Sir, kindly raise your right hand. You, Ceferino S. Rodolfo, do swear that the evidence you shall give in the case now pending between the Philippines and Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte shall be the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth. So help you God.

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:01.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I do.

00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:10.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly sit down. Dr. Rodolfo, ano po inyong palayaw kung paano namin kayo i-address?

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.730
