00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:14.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Perry?

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:20.210
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: And you are a doctor because you have a doctorate or you're a medical doctor?

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:23.960
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Doctorate po in Public Administration, Your Honor.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:32.680
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Dr. Perry, naunawaan niyo po ba inyong pinanumpaan kaugnay sa testimonyang ibibigay niyo sa harap ng impeachment court na ito?

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.060
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, Honorable Judge.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.960
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Salamat po. Kindly make your offer, Atty. Justin.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.160
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:48.170
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: What is the pleasure of Sen. Judge Erwin with the indulgence of Atty. Justin?

00:15:51.640 --> 00:16:04.610
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Presiding Officer, good morning and to all the Senator Judges. Ako po ay magtatanong sa sana and I'd like to comment

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:50.640
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: regarding these statements na binibitiwan po ng tagapagsalita po ng vice-presidente si Atty. Panelo discrediting witness credibility ng mga senator-judges. Can we do something about this, Mr. Presiding Officer? I mean, he's not party to this case, pero siya po ang tagapagsalita ng vicepresidente. Tama po ba yun? I mean, parang, I believe, parang meron mong problema po rito. I mean, you are the spokesperson of the vicepresident na on trial here, and then magkukomento ka hinggil sa mga senator judges, the impeachment court.

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:51.660
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: E

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:55.800
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: parang namang wala pong respeto sa ikang impeachment court.

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:01.620
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Presiding Officer, what can we do about this?

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:47.840
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Panelo is neither a lawyer of record nor a witness to this impeachment court. Neither is he a party and therefore not covered by Rule 18. However, given the suppletory application of the Rules of Court, particularly Rule 71 on contempt, He may be covered or under the authority of this Court not under Rule 18 of our Impeachment Rules but under Rule 71 of the Rules of Court and therefore susceptible to any orders that this Court may issue us against him in relation to speech or action made by him in connection with this Impeachment Court.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:18:11.840
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Yes, presiding officer. May I suggest that we ask for his explanation or probably summon in this court? Kasi hindi yung maganda tignan being the spokesperson. Baka nakakalimutan niya on trial here is yung boss niya, yung vice president and he's the spokesperson. Parang hindi naman po yata tama, Mr. presiding officer.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.400
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: While the presiding officer is not

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:43.730
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Prepared to say that the rules on agency would apply given that he is the spokesperson of the respondent, the chair will instead use simply the suppletory application of Rule 71. And if I understand the motion, instead of asking him to explain, it will be in the form of a show-cause order. Honorable Senator Judge Erwin, is that your pleasure, sir?

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.390
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Yes, Mr. Presiding Officer, that's my point, sir.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:59.650
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: I will therefore file a motion to issue a show cause order for the spokesperson of the Vice President.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:04.010
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Upon motion, there being no objection.

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:25.600
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Motion is hereby approved. Clerk of Court is directed to issue a show cause order to Attorney Paolo Panelo, in regard to his remarks made yesterday afternoon, if I'm not mistaken. Yes,

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.560
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Mr. Presiding Officer. Thank you.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:31.600
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Atty. Justin, your offer again.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:21:33.380
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor. Thank you. Turning back to my offer, Your Honor. Again, we are offering the testimony of the witness for the following purposes. Number one, that he is the Department of Trade and Industry, or DTI, Undersecretary for Industry Development and Investment Promotion. and as well the vice chairman and managing head of the board of investments number two pursuant to his authority under board resolution number 28-02 series of 2016 he issued CALE88 foods corporation certificate of registration number 2021-186 As an export enterprise engaged in PSIC 10309 manufacture of food products, export of producer of banana chips. Number three, CALE88 Foods Corporation is a duly registered export enterprise with a board of investments and is engaged in the lawful and legitimate business of producing and exporting banana chips. 4. That as a duly registered export enterprise with a board of investments, Calia 88 Foods Corporation is legally entitled to the following incentives. 1. Income Tax Holiday 2. Special Corporate Income Tax 3. Duty Exemption 4. VAT Exemption and Zero Rating Number 5, to disprove the material allegations under Article 2 of the Articles of Impeachment and the supposed forensic report of Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera to identify documents as well as to testify on matters related to the foregoing.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:37.580
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Comment.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:55.890
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor. For offer number one, we stipulate with regard to the position of this witness in the DTI. We We are amenable to stipulate on that. As to the rest, subject to cross, Your Honor.

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:08.100
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Justin, you may proceed accordingly in regard to the stipulation already made as to the qualification, position, and current job of the witness.

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:10.880
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Understood, Your Honor. Thank you for the stipulation, Attorney.

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:18.310
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sir, para lang po. I'm sorry. Good morning, Doc.

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.930
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Doc? Can you please tell us para malamang na natin what the Department of Trade and Industry is?

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:55.850
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: The DTI is a national government agency po that is in charge of several functions including number one yung consumer protection and number two po yung international trade relations po natin. Tapos number three po as it relates po dun sa grupo kung saan ako nakabilang. Yun pong tinatawag natin na industry development and investment promotion.

00:22:57.190 --> 00:23:05.330
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. And sir, how long have you been connected with the Department of Trade and Industry, sir? If you could please tell us.

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:47.740
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa pagkakaalala ko po, ako po ay naupo bilang una assistant secretary noong March 2013. Tapos po na-appoint po akong Undersecretary noong February 2016. Tapos hanggang ngayon po nandun po ako sa position na ito. Nabago lang po ng konti yung ginagampanan kong tungkulin. Pero dito po sa pinag-uusapan ngayon yung pagiging Managing Head ng Board of Investments since February 2016.

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:59.170
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. You mentioned about your position in the Board of Investments, sir. Para lang po malaman at maintindihan po nating lahat, ano po itong Board of Investments, sir?

00:23:59.670 --> 00:24:38.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang Board of Investments po, ito yung tinatawag natin na Lead Investment Promotion Agency ng gobyerno. Pag sinabi po nating investment promotion, Ang pananaw po namin dito ay hindi lang po siya promotion na marketing. Napakalaga ho na yung pagtingin namin dun sa promotion ay capital letter P. Meaning promoting the development of industries. Kasama po dyan yung policies, kasama po dyan yung capacity development, at saka po yung promotion. Kadugtong lang po yun.

00:24:40.180 --> 00:25:11.000
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Dagdag ko lang po. Ginagampanan ng Board of Investments yung pong pag-promulgate ng Strategic Investment Priorities Plan na doon po ay sinasabi po kung ano yung mga activities na priority ng gobyerno for incentives under the different incentive laws po ng gobyerno kamukha po ng Create More Law.

00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:18.770
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Ano po ang relasyon between the DTI and Board of Investments kung mayroon man, Sir?

00:25:19.590 --> 00:25:35.090
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung DTI po ang mother agency ng BOI. Kami po ay attached sa DTI. Ang kalihim po ng DTI ay nagsisilbing chairperson ng Board of Investments.

00:25:35.530 --> 00:25:46.520
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat po, Sir. Sir, pakiulit na lang po. Sorry, Atty. Erwin, I know this is stipulated but I'll just ask the witness. Dito po sa DTI, ano po yung position nyo?

00:25:47.400 --> 00:25:55.080
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ako po ay Undersecretary for Industrial Development and Investment Promotion.

00:25:55.320 --> 00:26:04.360
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, in relation to your position as an Undersecretary in the Department of Trade and Industry, ano po yung duties and responsibilities natin, sir?

00:26:06.710 --> 00:26:33.810
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasama po dito yung pag-oversee ng several bureaus po. Isa po ay yung Export Marketing Bureau. Yung isa po ay yung Bureau of Import Services. Tapos po ang isa po where I also serve as the head of agency ay yung Board of Investments.

00:26:34.470 --> 00:26:48.560
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Na-stipulate na rin po na ikaw po yung Vice Chairman and Managing Head ng Board of Investments. Pwede niyo po bang sabihin sa amin kung ano yung duties and responsibilities niyo kaugnay sa position na iyan, Sir?

00:26:49.300 --> 00:27:24.660
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Basically po, as Managing Head ng Board of Investments, eto po yung day-to-day operation ng Board of Investments supervising apat na Functional groups sa Board of Investments. Meron po tayong Management Services Group. Meron po tayong Industry Development Services Group. Meron po tayong Investment Promotions Group. At saka po, meron din po tayong Investor Assistance Services Group.

00:27:25.060 --> 00:27:48.960
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat, Sir. Sir, may sapi na pong in-issue yung Impeachment Court sa inyo at sa opisina nyo. In-instruct po kayo mag-produce ng certified true copies. Ang unang tanong po, kaugnay sa mga sapina na yun, ano yung mga letters na pinadala nyo sa impeachment court kaugnay sa pagsumite ng mga dokumento, sir? Kung mayroon man.

00:27:49.660 --> 00:28:08.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron po tayong pinadalang letter, November 18, addressed to the honorable presiding officer ng court po in compliance of the sapina. Enumerate ko po yung mga pinadala naming dokumento, subpoena documents.

00:28:08.800 --> 00:28:22.160
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sige po. Let's go to that letter dated November 18, 2026 po. Ano po ang mga nakasabi ng mga dokumento na ipinadala ng opisina niyo sa impeachment court na ito, kung mayroon man sir?

00:28:22.160 --> 00:29:41.850
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo. Letter A po ay BOI Certificate of Registration No. 2021-186 dated December 9, 2021, issued to CALE88 Foods Corporation. Letter B po yung site inspection report. Letter C, report submitted by the firm on the project start of commercial operations. Letter D po ay yung annual reports consisting of the following. Form S1 for taxable years 2023, 2024, and 2025. Audited financial statements for Taxable Year 2023, 2024, 2025. Letter E po ay VAT Zero Rating Certification for Taxable Year 2024 and 2026. Attached with Application Form, Bank Certification of Deposit and Sales Report. Letter F, Letter Request for Endorsement of Good Standing dated April 29, 2026. Letter G, travel order for site inspection approved on April 29, 2026. Letter H,

00:29:43.590 --> 00:30:35.120
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: report on site inspection undertaken on May 18, 2026. Letter I, endorsement of good standing dated June 16, 2026. Letter J, Certificate of Income Tax Holiday Incentive Entitlement issued to CALE88 Foods Corporation for taxable year 2024. Letter K, Letter Request for Change in the Ownership dated July 8, 2026 with the following attachment, General Information Sheet for 2024 and 2025. and letter L, letter of approval of the request for change in ownership.

00:30:35.560 --> 00:30:54.570
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat po, sir. Sir, sa baba, can we just request the tech not to take it down? Sa baba po ng letter na iyon, meron pong, there is a signature above the printed name, Dr. Ceferino Rodolfo po. Kaninong lagda po iyan kung alam niyo?

00:30:54.750 --> 00:30:55.490
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa akin po.

00:30:58.250 --> 00:31:04.490
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Ano po yung dokumento na sinubintin nyo sa impeachment court? Certified true copy or original ba?

00:31:05.370 --> 00:31:06.730
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Certified true copies po.

00:31:06.930 --> 00:31:26.170
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, we would just like to manifest that we will be marking the Board of Investments letter dated November 18, 2026 to this impeachment court and we request that it be marked as Exhibit D-2-1-CALE88, Your Honor.

00:31:26.560 --> 00:31:27.360
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So ordered.

00:31:27.850 --> 00:31:28.550
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor.

