00:32:00.990 --> 00:32:17.690
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sir, bukod sa BOI letter dated November 18, 2026, ano pong ibang letter ang ipinadala nyo sa impeachment court na ito patungkol sa pinanana-issue ng impeachment court na ito po? Kung mayroon man.

00:32:18.630 --> 00:32:47.820
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Mayroon po. Naka-date nga ako ng November 20, 2026. Kanina lang po namin inaabot po ito. Again, addressed to the Honorable Francis Escudero as the Presiding Officer of this Honorable Court. We have submitted the following documents. Number one po, memo request for printing of the Certificate of Registration dated December 14, 2021, signed by the

00:32:49.570 --> 00:32:55.090
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Our BOI Extension Office in Davao. Chief, si Gil Dureza.

00:32:55.470 --> 00:33:03.230
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Number 2. Sir, pardon, sorry to cut you. May we just request, Your Honor, that the document be flashed as well. I understand this was just recently.

00:33:03.250 --> 00:33:03.710
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The tech is so instructed.

