Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sorry.

00:33:05.570 --> 00:33:13.670
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: By the way, continuing authority, or rather authority and continuing authority to assisting counsel to approach with this at any point in time during this testimony is given.

00:33:15.100 --> 00:33:19.140
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: We are requesting that the letter dated November 20, 2026.

00:33:19.750 --> 00:33:21.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: It's not this. Tech, it's not this.

