00:35:40.400 --> 00:35:52.960
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat, sir. Sir, sa baba ng letra na yan, sa letter na yan, there again appears a signature above the printed name, Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo. Whose signature is that, sir, if you know?

00:35:53.250 --> 00:35:54.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung letter po ako yung pumirma.

00:35:54.950 --> 00:35:57.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is the nature of that document, sir? Is it original or certified?

00:35:59.210 --> 00:36:01.010
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Certified true copies po.

00:36:01.270 --> 00:36:17.630
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, we request that the Board of Investments letter dated November 20, 2026 be marked as Exhibit D-2-1-A-CALE88 for the defense, Your Honor.

