01:05:57.370 --> 01:06:16.250
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, we just request that the screenshot that we just confronted to the witness and the notice of publication as referred to in the testimony be marked as Defense Exhibit D-2-41-CALE88 and D-2-42-CALE88, Your Honor.

01:06:16.350 --> 01:06:16.770
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So ordered.

01:06:16.910 --> 01:06:44.260
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Now, balikan po natin yung Certificate of Registration po na issue. Sinabi niyo po kanina, Sir, That there are requirements before you can be issued a Certificate of Registration as an Export Enterprise. You confirmed that there is actually a Certificate of Registration of Export Enterprise. What does that mean, sir, in relation to CALE88's Foods Corporation's application with the Board of Investments?

01:06:44.840 --> 01:06:52.820
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang ibig sabihin nun, na-comply niya po yung mga requirements po for registration.

01:06:53.620 --> 01:06:54.240
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay.

01:06:56.350 --> 01:07:01.150
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, sir. And then, next, sir, I understand, sorry.

01:07:02.660 --> 01:07:17.340
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, in the certification directly, sir, Certificate of Registration No. 2021-186 dated December 9, 2021. For the record, can you just please tell us when this was issued based on that document?

01:07:18.570 --> 01:07:21.950
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: It was issued on December 9, 2021.

01:07:22.270 --> 01:07:31.270
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And can you please, for the record, tell us the expiry date? or the extent of validity of that document, sir?

01:07:31.630 --> 01:07:32.830
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po siyang expiration.

01:07:33.390 --> 01:07:34.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir.

01:07:34.250 --> 01:07:39.430
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Unless canceled in the future, but dito po sa certificate of registration, wala po.

01:07:39.630 --> 01:08:26.050
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, in that the same certificate of registration, sir, it states that, and I quote, this is to certify that the Board of Investments pursuant to its chapter and title 8 of the National Internal Revenue Code of 1998 as amended by Republic Act No. 11534 or the Corporate Recovery and Tax Incentive for Enterprise has duly registered CALE88 Foods Corporation with Tax Identification No. 602-289-083-0000 as an export enterprise. Para po maintindihan ng lahat, Ano po ang isang export enterprise sa mata ng Board of Investment, sir? And under the law?

01:08:26.610 --> 01:08:33.670
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po ay isang enterprise na nag-e-export ng at least 70% ng kanyang production.

01:08:35.960 --> 01:08:40.660
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And when you say 70% of production, sir, what does that refer to, sir?

01:08:41.640 --> 01:08:44.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Either production volume po or production value.

01:08:45.120 --> 01:09:20.110
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, on the same document, sir, still on Certificate of Registration Number 2021-186, dated December 9, 2028, issued in favor of CALE88 Foods Corporation, it states that, and I quote, PSIC 10309, manufacturer of food products, in close parenthesis, new export producer of banana chips. Para sa amin po na hindi masyadong pamilyar, ano ang ibig sabihin ng PSIC 10309, Sir? What does that stand for?

01:09:21.380 --> 01:09:33.810
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung Philippine Standard Industrial Classification Code or System sa atin pong Philippine Statistics Authority.

01:09:36.500 --> 01:09:52.540
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron pong mga specific codes that corresponds to specific industries. Para po pag naglilikom sila ng mga reports, tama hong maiswak yung mga numero, yung mga data doon sa particular activity na iyon.

01:09:52.760 --> 01:10:31.350
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat sir. Now puntahan po natin yung bottom portion ng Certificate of Registration number 2021-186 dated December 9, 2021. It states and I quote, The aforementioned registered project or activity is entitled to the following incentives. Income tax holiday, special corporate income tax, duty exemption, and VAT exemption and zero rating. Bago po natin puntahan yung bawat na incentives na yan sir. Gusto ko lang po at namin malaman, bakit po ba binibigyan natin ng mga incentives yung mga export enterprise natin?

01:10:33.660 --> 01:10:48.480
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Dahil po sa nakakapag-generate po sila ng trabaho, dahil po sa tingin natin yung value addition po dito sa mga ginagawa po nila ay may kinabang po ang ekonomiya po natin.

01:10:48.680 --> 01:10:54.440
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And just to give us an idea sir, how many export enterprises do we have in the Philippines currently?

01:10:54.920 --> 01:10:58.040
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I don't have the data currently with me po.

01:10:58.260 --> 01:11:14.310
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, that's okay sir. Next. Let's go specifically to the incentives. It states there that CALE88 Foods Corporation is entitled to income tax holiday. Ano po yung meaning ng income tax holiday, sir?

01:11:14.510 --> 01:11:51.260
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung income tax holiday po ibig sabihin po, so pag nag-ooperate ka, meron ka pong kita, may revenue ka, ileles mo po yung mga cost mo, pagkatapos po sa pinakababa po, meron kang net income. Yung net income mo po ordinarily kung hindi ka nakaregister for incentives, you will be subjected to an income tax. Yung income tax po natin pagka ang alam ko po sa CREATE law, 25% yun yung normal income tax, nagiging 20% po pagka micro-small enterprises ka po.

01:11:51.480 --> 01:11:52.200
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So

01:11:52.200 --> 01:11:53.840
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: hindi niya po kailangan bayaran yun.

01:11:54.900 --> 01:12:07.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sinabi niyo po na 20% if SM... On the part of CALE88, kasi sinabi dito na entitled siya to income tax holiday, what is the repercussion? Ano pong epekto nito?

01:12:08.440 --> 01:12:25.020
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po siya magbabayad ng income tax. Sa limbawa po, pag nag-start na po siya ng commercial operation, kung ano man po yung net income niya na dapat masubject ng 20% income tax, hindi na po niya babayaran yun for a period of 6 years.

01:12:25.530 --> 01:12:37.290
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Actually, that was my next question, sir. Next, sir. Okay. So, just to confirm, sir, the income tax holiday that CALE88 Foods Corporation is entitled to, how long, sir? Just for the record.

01:12:37.330 --> 01:12:38.030
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Anim na taon, po.

01:12:38.110 --> 01:12:42.450
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. And yung anim na taon, san po yan rekond, po?

01:12:42.810 --> 01:12:45.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa date ng start of commercial operation, po.

01:12:46.010 --> 01:12:48.710
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So, hindi sa issuance ng Certificate of Registration?

01:12:48.830 --> 01:12:49.330
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Just for clarifications.

01:12:49.330 --> 01:12:49.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Hindi po.

01:12:49.830 --> 01:13:05.490
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Next. Yung pangalawang benefit na nakasabi dito or incentive to be accurate is special corporate income tax. Again sir, para maunawaan natin, ano po ang ibig sabihin itong special corporate income tax?

01:13:06.810 --> 01:13:31.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pagkatapos niyang ma-exhaust yung 6 na taon na income tax holiday, susundan po yun, magbabayad na po siya ng tax. Pero ang tax na babayaran niya po ay special. Ito pong tinatawag natin na SCIT for 10 years. Ang SCIT po ay 5% tax on gross income.

01:13:32.400 --> 01:13:42.680
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Now, sinabi niyo po na SCIT is, the entitlement to SCIT is 10 years. When do you recon the start of that 10 years, sir?

01:13:42.880 --> 01:13:47.700
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: After po mag-expire yung... ITH, yung income tax holiday.

01:13:48.740 --> 01:13:50.220
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir, please continue sir.

01:13:50.320 --> 01:14:05.180
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So on the 6th year from start of commercial operation, yun po yung last year na may kinabang po siya dun sa totally walang income tax. On the 7th year, magsisimula na po yung 5% tax on the gross.

01:14:05.860 --> 01:14:13.340
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir. And for the record sir, if you just know, when was the actual start of operations of CALE88 Foods Corporation?

01:14:14.510 --> 01:14:15.450
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Check ko lang o sandali.

01:14:15.550 --> 01:14:16.430
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir, of course.

01:14:23.820 --> 01:14:39.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Initially po sa application nila sa atin, sabi niya po ang start of commercial operation niya ay January 2022 pero pinamove niya po to January 2023. So ang reckoning po namin January 2023.

01:14:40.100 --> 01:14:53.960
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir. So on the basis of that document sir, stating that the Actual start of operations of CALE88 Foods Corporation is January 1, 2023. Until when is it entitled to an income tax holiday?

01:14:56.110 --> 01:14:57.070
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 2028 po.

01:14:57.250 --> 01:15:02.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And until when is it entitled to a special corporate income tax?

01:15:02.030 --> 01:15:08.160
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So that will be 2029 to 2038.

01:15:10.570 --> 01:15:25.810
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Pasensya na pa-compute ko po kayo. Next, sir. It also states that one of the incentives given to CALE88 Foods Corporation is duty exemption. Can you please explain to us po what this duty exemption means?

01:15:26.330 --> 01:15:38.330
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung dito po sa create law, pagka po mag-i-import siya ng mga capital equipment, exempted po yun from paying duties o mga taripa.

01:15:38.720 --> 01:15:43.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At bakit po binibigyan natin ng duty exemption itong mga export enterprise natin?

01:15:44.100 --> 01:15:51.300
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Again, kasama po ito dun sa mga incentive para sa mga sectors and activities that we are promoting.

01:15:52.340 --> 01:16:02.700
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Next is a VAT exemption and zero rating, sir. Can you please explain to us what a VAT exemption and zero rating means?

01:16:04.760 --> 01:16:34.340
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Mahalaga po ito dahil po ordinarily, Magbabayad ka po yung supplier mo po kasama doon sa mga ibibili sa iyo na pag bumili ka ng materyales kasama po yung VAT. Ipapasa niya po sa iyo yun. Pagka meron kang VAT zero rating na certificate, yun pong supplier mo hindi ka na pagbabayari ng VAT. So I think 12% din po yung VAT na yun. So makakatipid ka po doon.

01:16:34.400 --> 01:16:45.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. And ano po ang entitlement ni CALE88 sa income tax, holiday, special corporate income tax, duty exemption, and VAT exemption zero rating to this day, sir?

01:16:47.080 --> 01:16:50.240
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Are they still entitled to those?

01:16:50.420 --> 01:16:50.900
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes, po.

01:16:51.200 --> 01:17:09.280
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, you mentioned we also tackled all these incentives, sir. Now, what relation do the specific terms and conditions and the general terms of conditions That you produced in your subpoena have to those incentives, sir? Ano po ang relasyon nila?

01:17:10.760 --> 01:17:30.950
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yun pong specific terms and conditions niya. Kailangan po compliance siya dun sa mga inagreehan niya ho na specific terms and conditions para maging eligible po siya dun to receive the incentives.

01:17:32.170 --> 01:17:41.410
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At ano naman po yung, meron din po kasi akong nakitang dokumento na general terms and conditions. Ano po yung pagkaiba niya sa special terms and conditions?

01:17:41.490 --> 01:18:00.010
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung general terms and conditions, ito po yung applicable sa lahat. Pero para sa project na po ito, dahil doon siya sa specific item po na export producer, so ito po yung requirement. As it applies to the project po, ito po yung requirement niya.

01:18:01.720 --> 01:18:17.070
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: The next document we'll discuss, sir, is the external contact report or plant visit. We request the tech to prepare the document as well. You confirm na isa din po ito sa mga dokumento na you submitted to this impeachment court, sir?

01:18:18.150 --> 01:18:19.230
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Patignan lang po muna.

01:18:35.160 --> 01:18:38.860
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang date po ba niyan ay December 3, 2021?

01:18:39.660 --> 01:18:40.020
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, sir.

01:18:40.080 --> 01:18:40.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: That is correct, sir.

01:18:41.360 --> 01:18:43.580
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes. I confirm po.

01:18:43.780 --> 01:18:55.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes. Now, puntahan po natin Under the label details, sir, may checkmark d'yon po sa box na quote-unquote plant visit. Ano pong ibig sabihin nito, sir?

01:18:57.750 --> 01:19:09.730
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Binisita po rin nila yung planta. Kaya lang po dahil pandemic noon, on-site po ang pag-visit. Sorry, sorry. Virtual po ang naging pag-bisita po.

01:19:11.570 --> 01:19:25.540
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nagkaroon ng... Hindi ko alam kung Zoom ang ginamit o Teams na meeting tapos pinakita doon sa ating mga taga BOI yun pong facilities.

01:19:26.640 --> 01:19:35.980
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes. And sir, how is this site visit important sir in respect to an application for a BOI certificate of registration?

01:19:37.100 --> 01:19:40.860
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para po ma-establish na merong facility.

01:19:42.700 --> 01:20:29.700
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Next sir, let's go to the label under highlights of the activity of the same document. It states there, during the conduct of the virtual plant visit via Google Meet, it was verified that the proposed project, export producer of banana, may qualify under underlined new activity based on the following findings below. First, the company's building is still under construction, around 90% completed. Second, some of the listed equipment, sorting table, sieving machine, metal detector, slicing machine, genset are still for acquisition. There were no raw materials, e.g., cardava banana, carton boxes, packaging material seen during the inspection.

01:20:30.080 --> 01:20:49.990
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, what makes me curious is how do you reconcile Those findings during the site inspection and the eventual issuance of a certificate of registration number 2021-186 on December 9, 2021 by the BOI in favor of CALE88. Kasi parang dyan sir, may kulang sir.

01:20:52.910 --> 01:21:25.090
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pag tinanggap po nila yung terms and conditions, ibig sabihin po, sinasabi po nila, okay, sinasabi lang po namin, registered ka. Pero bago ka makakuha ng incentives mo, sorry, maalala niyo po may start of commercial operation ka. Yun pong incentive mo, papakinabangan mo lang po pag nag start of commercial operation ka na po. So bago po siya mag start of commercial operation and makinabang siya dun sa mga incentive, kailangan po nakaayos na po itong mga ito.

01:21:25.680 --> 01:22:06.900
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: On page 2 of that same document, sir. It also states under subtitle C, start of commercial operation, the firm proposes to commence its commercial operation on December 2021, original target. However, due to COVID-19 pandemic, the construction of the building was delayed and the movement of people, construction workers, was hampered. The BOI Davao team advised the firm relative to the assessment of the building to move the start of commercial operation to a later date. e.g. January 2022 to give ample time for completion of the building and installation. Ano po ang ibig sabihin ng part na ito ng report, sir?

01:22:08.800 --> 01:22:30.900
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ibig sabihin lang po na na-move po yung start, yung kanyang target ng start of commercial operation but eventually po ang naging start ng commercial operation niya is 2023, January 2020. Pinapayagan naman po yun eh because you have three years from date of registration for you to have your SEO.

01:22:31.040 --> 01:23:01.400
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Now, on the last page of this external contact report plant visit on December 3, 2021, we request the tech to flash the photos. There appears to be photos of a Google meeting. Can we zoom in on the people? And that first. What is this? What is the relevance of this? screenshot or photo documentation in relation to the inspection sir?

01:23:02.780 --> 01:23:16.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pinapakita lang po niya na nagkaroon talaga po sila ng inspection meeting although virtual. Tapos sinasubmit din po ito doon sa Manila office sa amin po.

01:23:17.420 --> 01:23:32.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At kung alam niyo lang po sir, On the bottom left portion of that Google Meet, there appears a person wearing a green polo with having a floral pattern. Do you know this? Who is this person if you know, sir?

01:23:32.830 --> 01:23:40.830
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko siya personally kilala pero tinanong ko yung ating mga taga-Davao na officials kung sino po siya.

01:23:41.620 --> 01:23:44.700
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And sino po according to your Davao officials, sir?

01:23:44.860 --> 01:23:48.720
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sabi po nila siya po si Doktora Lebosada.

01:23:49.370 --> 01:24:18.980
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, we ask the tech to scroll down to the other photos. Now, as you can see displayed on the screen, sir, there appears to be structures or photos of structures attached to your inspection report. Can we also see the other photos for the consumption of the public and our senator judges? What are these photos for, sir, in relation to the inspection conducted by the Board of Investments?

01:24:19.610 --> 01:24:28.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung mga pinadalang litrato ng CALE88 na ito po yung tinatayo nilang facility para dun sa project.

01:24:28.590 --> 01:24:33.310
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And when you say facility and project, sir, can we be specific? What does that mean, sir?

01:24:33.490 --> 01:24:41.170
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung for the manufacture of banana chips for export purposes.

01:24:41.770 --> 01:24:49.680
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At yung mga structure, mga planta ba yan, sir? Can we please be clarified on what those photos pertain to?

01:24:51.300 --> 01:24:54.760
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Speculative. The witness would not be competent to identify what these photos are.

01:24:54.760 --> 01:24:59.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, these photos are submitted to their office, Your Honor. And they stipulated on these documents.

01:24:59.970 --> 01:25:05.620
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: It would be hearsay, Your Honor. He wasn't part of the people who made this virtual inspection.

01:25:06.020 --> 01:25:09.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Court will allow it as part of the official records submitted to his office.

01:25:09.680 --> 01:25:16.220
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Sir, if you could explain these photos, sir, what these structures are.

01:25:16.850 --> 01:25:49.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa sinabi po ng ating Davao office, ito po yung landing area. May kita niyo po kung saan i-receive yung mga raw materials. Pagkatapos po, ito po puro external structure po itong napakita rito. Pero sinasabi po na yung nasa loob yun po yung merong facilities, yung mga lutuan para doon sa mag-manufacture ng banana chips. Based on representation po sa amin nung Davao office po namin.

01:25:49.770 --> 01:26:08.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sorry for interrupting sir and maraming salamat. Next naman sir, one of the documents that you submitted is also CALE88 Food Corporation's report on actual date of start of commercial operations, initial investment, and employment. Can you please explain what this document is about sir?

01:26:19.940 --> 01:26:34.670
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung requirement ng BOI. na i-submit po nila isang notarized document para ma-trigger po sa amin na oh nag-i-start na itong project na ito ng commercial operation.

01:26:35.090 --> 01:26:43.310
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And why does the Board of Investments have this document on file on its record, sir? What is the importance of this document?

01:26:43.470 --> 01:26:55.650
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para ko alam namin yung reckoning date kung saan po siya nag-start ng commercial operation for purposes. of monitoring ng eligibility niya dun sa kanyang mga incentives.

01:26:56.250 --> 01:27:02.750
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. And as appearing on that document, sir, what is the actual start of commercial operations?

01:27:03.730 --> 01:27:05.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: January 1, 2023.

01:27:05.950 --> 01:27:21.600
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And under the subparagraph on employment, can we please focus it on the tech booth as well? Can you please tell us the number of labor at the actual start of operations as reported in that notarized? Report, sir?

01:27:23.580 --> 01:27:25.560
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 117 po yung sa direct labor.

01:27:27.470 --> 01:27:31.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And ilan po ang administrative in sales na nalatay ko?

01:27:31.190 --> 01:27:31.610
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Isa po.

01:27:32.150 --> 01:27:41.390
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, on the right side, on the rightmost column, it states payroll. What is that? What does that pertain to, sir?

01:27:44.440 --> 01:27:53.520
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung sweldo ng mga naka-indicate po na number ng mga tao na nandun po sa middle column.

01:27:54.120 --> 01:28:17.630
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Now, one of the documents that you submitted as well to this impeachment court is CALE88 Foods Corporation's Board of Investment Form S-1 or the Annual Report on Actual Operations for the year 2023. Before we go into that document, sir, can you please tell us more about what the Board of Investment Form S-1 is?

01:28:18.770 --> 01:28:38.310
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung isang importanteng dokumento po dahil ito yung nirequire po natin sa mga registered business enterprises to submit to us na notarized para namomonitor po natin yung compliance din nila doon sa kanilang mga pinangako at tinanggap na specific terms and conditions.

01:28:38.910 --> 01:28:44.350
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what information is contained in that BOI form S-1, if any, sir?

01:28:45.010 --> 01:29:06.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron po dito, siyempre po, yung basic information about the project. Tapos po, yung mga equity profile, yung gross income niya po for the year. Ito po kasi sinasubmit ito dapat bago mag April 30 of the succeeding year. Kasi po,

01:29:10.700 --> 01:29:15.740
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nakatapat din po yun dun sa pag-file niya po ng income tax return po niya.

01:29:16.080 --> 01:29:54.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Maraming salamat, sir. Puntaan po natin yung BOI Form S-1 for the year 2023, sir. We request the tech as well. Specifically on page 4 thereof, sir. My question is, if you could see it, sir, under the table labeled as labor generation, Specifically on the aggregate number of employees, how many are the aggregate number of administrative slash sales employees of CALE88 Foods Corporation as reported in the year 2023 sir? Can we request the tech booth to zoom the numbers?

01:29:55.920 --> 01:30:06.990
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Page 4 po ba yung... ito. The number

01:30:07.020 --> 01:30:13.960
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: The number of administrative and sales employees, sir, as indicated in that report?

01:30:16.590 --> 01:30:17.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Four po.

01:30:17.870 --> 01:30:20.780
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: How about the direct labor, sir? How many?

01:30:20.780 --> 01:30:21.740
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 115.

01:30:23.420 --> 01:30:30.400
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. And again, sir, ano po yung annual payroll expense of the aggregate number of employees? What does that column mean?

