01:31:47.560 --> 01:32:03.000
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, next, sir, on the same table, if you can look at below that total production, it also states export sales. Now, there is an indication, volume of export sales. What does that mean, sir?

01:32:03.900 --> 01:32:11.260
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung quantity as expressed dito po in kilograms.

01:32:13.220 --> 01:32:24.020
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And according to this report made by CALE88 Foods Corporation, what is the volume of export sales in the year 2023 of banana chips, sir?

01:32:24.880 --> 01:32:27.120
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 216,000 kilograms po.

01:32:27.470 --> 01:32:34.730
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, below that number is value. What is that number? What does that number pertain to, sir?

01:32:34.930 --> 01:32:43.730
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yun pong revenue niya dahil naibenta niya po sa labas dahil export po ito yung 216,000 kilograms na yan.

01:32:43.930 --> 01:32:51.730
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Sir, you also submitted other BOI form S-1 for the subsequent years, sir. Tama po ba?

01:32:52.130 --> 01:32:52.730
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

01:32:53.310 --> 01:33:15.110
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now... I will no longer belabor the other forms but my only question sir is if you look at the BOI form S-1 for the year 2025, it appears to be different than those in the prior years 2023 and 2024. Can you please explain to us sir why there is a difference between those forms?

01:33:15.750 --> 01:33:20.690
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nag-iba na po kami ng form kasi between those years.

01:33:21.720 --> 01:33:24.400
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So nothing is wrong with that change sir?

01:33:24.750 --> 01:33:25.170
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ano po?

01:33:25.290 --> 01:33:27.590
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Wala namang pong mali dyan. Just to confirm.

01:33:27.690 --> 01:33:28.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po. Wala.

01:33:28.410 --> 01:33:51.650
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, next sir, you also submitted audited financial statements of CALE88 Foods Corporation specifically for the years 2023, 2024, and 2025. How is this related or relevant to the earlier BOI Form S-1 that were submitted by CALE88 Foods Corporation? If at all, sir.

01:33:51.870 --> 01:34:02.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Submitted din po ito sa amin ng CALE88. Part 2 ng requirements namin for monitoring, kailangan nila mag-submit ng S-1 at saka ng audited financial statements po.

01:34:03.150 --> 01:34:07.930
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is the reason that they need to submit that together with the S-1, sir?

01:34:08.430 --> 01:34:18.830
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Binabangga din po natin yung mga numero na nakikita po natin doon sa S-1 po nila, doon sa kanila, audited financial statements, kung nagtutugma po.

01:34:19.230 --> 01:34:45.210
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, thank you, sir. Next, you also submitted as part of the documents that you submitted to the impeachment court, CALE88 Foods Corporations VAT zero rate certification dated May 2, 2024 and another one VAT zero rate certification dated April 10, 2026. At meron po itong mga supporting documents. Do you have those documents with you now, sir?

01:34:45.570 --> 01:34:46.250
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

01:34:47.470 --> 01:34:53.450
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, unahin po natin yung na unang zero VAT certification dated May 2, 2024.

01:34:59.820 --> 01:35:06.740
