01:35:18.620 --> 01:35:29.570
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Dahil... Under din po ng kanyang management services yung ating mga legal service at yung ating incentives and compliance division po.

01:35:30.290 --> 01:35:37.210
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And kanino pong VAT zero rate certification yan based on the document sir?

01:35:37.550 --> 01:35:39.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para po kay CALE88.

01:35:39.690 --> 01:35:57.600
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now at the bottom of that document sir, can we scroll down? There's a signature above the printed name, Atty. Bobby G. Fondevilla. Again, sir, can we clarify? Fondevilla. Can you please tell us what his position is and what his authority is to sign that?

01:35:57.860 --> 01:36:04.040
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: At that time po siya po yung Executive Director ng Management Services.

01:36:04.620 --> 01:36:10.160
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, on the right side, sir, there also appears a QR code. What is the purpose of that QR code, sir?

01:36:10.440 --> 01:36:16.100
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para pag po binaril po ito, ilalabas din niyo po niya yung BOI VAT Certificate na ito po.

01:36:16.620 --> 01:36:30.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. We now have seen that in the year 2024, there's actually a VAT zero rate certification. What is the purpose of this VAT zero rate certification in relation to CALE88, sir?

01:36:31.050 --> 01:36:46.770
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para po ito yung papakita ni CALE88 dun sa kanyang mga suppliers na inindicate din po niya sa kanyang VAT zero rating application form para po hindi siya singilin ng VAT nung suppliers na yun.

01:36:47.000 --> 01:36:54.120
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Again sir, why is it important that our enterprises are given this incentive sir? Para lang po malaman natin.

01:36:54.300 --> 01:37:08.620
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para po hindi siya sisingilin ng 12% VAT, hindi ipapasa sa CALE88. So mas makakatipid po siya nung pag bumili po siya nung in this particular case po ay gagamitin niya po ito for

01:37:12.880 --> 01:37:20.320
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: oil, coconut oil, carton boxes, tsaka plastics na kanyang mga bibilin po.

01:37:20.800 --> 01:37:29.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. And sir, what are the requirements for the Board of Investments to issue that VAT zero rate certification in general, sir? And if you know.

01:37:33.220 --> 01:37:35.220
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pwede akong tumingin sa dokumento ko.

01:37:35.220 --> 01:37:35.540
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, sir.

01:37:49.880 --> 01:38:11.580
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ano po, nung time na nag-apply po siya nito, nung 2024, duly accomplished application form, notarized affidavit signed by the firm's authorized representative, enumerating the documents submitted to BOI, duly notarized sales performance report for the year.

01:38:12.040 --> 01:38:55.620
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: For the year immediately preceding the period to be covered by the certification. Ibig sabihin po kung 2024 po ito, yung pong kanyang mga sales performance is for 2023. Duly notarized detailed export sales report and annual production for the year. immediately preceding the period to be covered by the certification. Original and notarized bank certifications explicitly indicating inward remittances due to export proceeds. Copy of annual report of operations, yung S1 po natin. Latest audited financial statement.

01:38:57.600 --> 01:39:33.540
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Barangay and Unaudited income statement for the year preceding the period to be covered by the certification. Barangay certification indicating that the firm is existing and operating. Mayor's permit, business permit. Pictures of the production area and signage of plant factory. Copy of BOI certificate of registration with specific terms and conditions. Copy of sworn declaration affidavits per BIR template. Pero in-streamline na natin ito rin noong 2026.

01:39:34.360 --> 01:39:51.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, sir. Now, after CALE88, Foods Corporation submitted its requirements. What process does the Board of Investment do prior to granting? What is the assessment that it makes essentially?

01:39:52.010 --> 01:40:20.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Una, tinitignan niya kung na-submit itong mga ito. Tapos pangalawa, importante lang din ito kasi titignan niya kung na-meet niya po yung 70-30 na export sales requirement. Dabangga din niya yung bank certificate na nagpapatunay na may mga inward remittances siya galing sa kanyang mga Buyers from abroad.

01:40:20.840 --> 01:40:41.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So, this is confirmatory, sir. Talagang ina-assess at kinuscrutinize ng board investments yung application. Thank you, sir. Let's go to Annex A of that VAT 0 certification, sir. It's one of the documents you attached. I think that would be the document after that certification. Ano po itong dokumento na ito, sir?

01:41:11.400 --> 01:41:40.100
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nire-refer lang ko nito, naka-attach ko ito dun sa certification. Mas detalyade lang ko ito, sinasabi niya kung ano yung registered activity, tapos ano yung tax incentive entitlement niya, tapos ano yung performance conditions, tapos saan mga goods niya pwedeng ibangga ito, yung attributable goods and services.

01:41:40.790 --> 01:41:41.130
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you sir.

01:41:41.130 --> 01:41:42.210
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Na nakalagay po dito.

01:41:42.810 --> 01:41:47.670
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Pasensya sir. Thank you sir. Sinabi niyo po naka-attach. Sino pong nag-prepare ng dokumento na yan?

01:41:48.330 --> 01:41:50.270
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang BOI po yung nag-prepare nito.

01:41:50.450 --> 01:42:05.010
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Sir, let's go still to that document. If you look at the lower right portion, if my memory serves me right, sinabi po yan terms and conditions. Tapos, can we please zoom in on that portion?

01:42:06.620 --> 01:42:20.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: That would be on the fifth or fourth column. Thank you. Now, in the terms of conditions, on the right column, it says status remarks compliant. What does that mean in relation to CALE88 Foods Corporation?

01:42:21.560 --> 01:42:29.860
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Na-complied po siya dito sa mga terms and conditions ng kanyang registration. Performance commitment.

01:42:31.490 --> 01:42:40.010
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, yung performance commitment tapos merong 70%, what does that... Part of the table means, sir. Can you please explain?

01:42:40.090 --> 01:42:51.960
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ibig sabihin po yung kanyang benta sa export is within 70% ng kanyang total sales. Nakocomply niya po yun.

01:42:52.140 --> 01:42:55.280
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And the Board of Investments kinoconfirm yung export, sir.

01:42:55.820 --> 01:42:58.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Basit po dun sa mga sinabit niya sa aming mga dokumento.

01:42:58.500 --> 01:43:04.080
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, below that, it's regulatory compliance and it states complied.

01:43:04.330 --> 01:43:21.880
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: General term kasi sir. Sorry. Yung performance commitment po pala, ang tingin ko ito yung sa employment. Kasi may nakaseparate na export ratio tayong nakalagay sa...

01:43:21.880 --> 01:43:28.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay sir. In the regulatory compliance, it says complied. What does that mean sir?

01:43:29.240 --> 01:43:32.260
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So ibig sabihin po, nagsubmit siya sa amin yung S1.

01:43:33.780 --> 01:43:35.860
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay sir.

01:43:37.760 --> 01:43:50.350
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now what... Now, sinabi niyo po may mga pruweba. Now, one of the documents I noticed in the documents in relation to VAT zero certification are bank statements. Tama po ba, sir?

01:43:50.490 --> 01:43:50.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tama.

01:43:52.350 --> 01:44:05.070
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: What is the relevance of these bank statements from CALE88 Foods Corporation in relation to its application for a VAT zero rate certification? May we request that that bank statement be flashed?

01:44:10.070 --> 01:44:13.790
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Ano po ang relevance niyan sa application? Why is it important?

01:44:14.310 --> 01:44:34.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para mapatunayan namin na meron siyang pumapasok na foreign exchange na galing sa labas. Dahil kasi kung mag-iexport siya, normally yung bayad is foreign exchange tapos pumapasok sa banko. So pinapatunayan lang po nito na may pumasok po.

01:44:34.950 --> 01:44:42.390
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, in relation to those as well, there are affidavits. May we request the tech to refer to those affidavits.

01:44:45.150 --> 01:44:56.670
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sino po ang mga nakapirma ng mga affidavit in relation to the VAT zero rate certification dated May 2, 2024 issued by the Board of Investments?

01:45:07.830 --> 01:45:11.750
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung nakapirma po si Dr. Lourdes Lebosada.

01:45:12.010 --> 01:45:15.810
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And ano po ang date ng notarization ng sworn affidavit na yan?

01:45:15.970 --> 01:45:18.130
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: March 8, 2024 po.

01:45:18.510 --> 01:45:23.370
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And ano po ang relasyon ng sworn affidavit na yan sa application for zero-rate certification?

01:45:24.130 --> 01:45:32.030
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kailangan po ito para dun sa ano? Kailangan niya pong i-attach ito dun sa kanyang application form.

01:45:32.390 --> 01:45:53.320
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, meron din po kayong sinubmit na CALE88 Foods Corporation VAT zero-rate certification dated April 10, 2026 at may mga supporting documents. Now, again, just to confirm, sino yung nag-issue ng certificate na yan, sir?

01:45:53.500 --> 01:45:56.520
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Dito po si Executive Director Fe Del Rosario.

01:45:57.690 --> 01:46:03.670
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At sino po si Executive Director Fe Del Rosario po?

01:46:03.830 --> 01:46:10.950
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya na po yung Executive Director ng Management Services ng BOI. Okay. Nung in-issue po ito.

01:46:11.750 --> 01:46:25.800
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, sinabi nyo na po kanina na one of the documents that you need to submit, To be entitled to a VAT zero rate certificate are affidavits sir. Tama po ba? At ano po itong mga affidavits na to nga sir?

01:46:26.200 --> 01:46:36.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Itong dito po yung affidavit po na nagsasabi na limbawa po dito po sa for this particular can I read na lang po?

01:46:36.680 --> 01:46:37.140
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir please.

01:46:37.340 --> 01:47:18.510
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: For this particular 2020-2026 submission Afidavit po ito ni Salvador Leo Sacurom na sinasabi na siya yung current na accounting and compliance officer ng CALE88 that inauthorize siya ng mga board of directors to transact business with us na siya po yung authorized representative ng CALE88 for their application for VAT zero rating. Tapos na siya rin po yung nag-prepare at nag-submit ng mga forms that we were requiring for this VAT zero rating application.

01:47:21.410 --> 01:47:41.730
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Now, we don't need to flash these documents for the 2026 with respect to the banks to protect the privacy. But my question, sir, if you look at the documents you submitted, in the certificate of inward remittance, Meron pong mga remitter dyan na naka-indicate. Do you see that, sir?

01:47:42.550 --> 01:47:42.830
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo.

01:47:43.190 --> 01:47:57.610
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, marami po kasing Zhengzhou Food Call Limited. What is the reason why these remittances should be reported, sir, in relation to VAT zero certification?

01:47:58.810 --> 01:48:06.710
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para ma-identify lang po kung sino yung mga nag-re-remit ng mga customer po niyan. Pinagbentahan po ng kumpanya.

01:48:10.720 --> 01:48:33.550
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, meron pa rin... We don't need to flash this, but there's also a certificate of inward remittance from security bank. Meron ding mga what appears to be Chinese corporations. What is the importance of CALE88 Foods Corporation submitting these inward remittances to the Board of Investments?

01:48:33.770 --> 01:48:44.150
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Again po, para mapatunayan po namin na may pumapasok sa kanya na export revenues. Hindi po namin nire-require kung galing sa ang bansa.

01:48:45.240 --> 01:48:56.000
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Now, another document submitted is also CALE88 Foods Corporation's Detailed Export Sales and Annual Production Report. Do you have that, sir?

01:49:08.160 --> 01:49:13.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Baka after na nito. Mas detailed ito. Ito ba yun?

01:49:16.010 --> 01:49:36.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Opo, yes. Now, I've actually reviewed that document, sir. And very many product exports were done to Chinese companies or to China. With corresponding sales volume and sales value. What is the relevance of that document in relation to an application for VAT zero rate certifications?

01:49:37.310 --> 01:49:40.810
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So, para ma-establish lang po na meron siyang export sales.

01:49:41.710 --> 01:49:49.790
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, sinabi niyo po kanina sir, before a VAT zero rate certification is issued na na-issue naman po ng BOI, nag-a-assess po.

01:49:49.950 --> 01:49:50.570
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: What

01:49:50.570 --> 01:49:58.690
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: irregularities, if any, did the BOI find in relation to those China-related transactions or exports, if at all?

01:49:58.990 --> 01:50:15.780
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang pinaka tinitignan lang po namin dito ay kung pasok po siya dun sa 70% na export na requirement po niya. Sinisigurado lang namin na yung exports niya hindi bababa sa 70%.

01:50:15.780 --> 01:50:21.660
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So to confirm sir, the BOI found no issue in exportations relation to China.

01:50:21.660 --> 01:50:24.380
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: On the export requirement po.

01:50:24.480 --> 01:50:37.670
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you sir. Now, one of the documents that you also submitted is CALE88 Foods Corporation's letter dated April 29, 2026. May we just request the tech to flash that document?

01:50:47.560 --> 01:51:01.290
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Do you have it with you sir? Now, can you please explain to us what the purpose of this letter request is as it is addressed to Attorney Elyjean DC Portoza, sir?

01:51:01.950 --> 01:51:39.860
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, eto po ay nagre-request po si CALE88 ng Certification of Good Standing dahil po si CALE88 ay Nagpapa rin yun yung kanyang accreditation dun sa parang client profile system ng Bureau of Customs para ho tuloy-tuloy ho yung kanyang capability to import and export. Requirement po kasi yun ng Bureau of Customs na may certificate of good standing po siya galing sa amin.

01:51:40.060 --> 01:51:58.480
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Now, naka-address po yung letter ng CALE88 Foods Corporation dated April 29, 2026 kay Atty. Elyjean DC Portoza. Sino po itong si Atty. Elyjean DC Portoza? Can you please explain why the letter had to be addressed to her?

01:51:58.730 --> 01:52:09.970
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya po yung director ng aming legal and compliance services. So sila po yung mga nagmo-monitor ng standing po ng mga registered business enterprises.

01:52:10.980 --> 01:52:24.400
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, alam natin sir na ito po yung letter na ipinadala ni CALE88 Foods Corporation sa Board of Investments. Can you please tell us what a certificate of good standing or endorsement of good standing means, sir?

01:52:25.140 --> 01:52:46.140
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, I'd have to object to this line of questioning on the ground of relevance. In the first place, Your Honor, this document already pertains to April 29, 2026. which is outside the period covered by the charges in the articles. It doesn't even pertain to taxable year 2025. It pertains to 2026, Your Honor.

01:52:46.730 --> 01:52:51.550
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: We note the manifestation of Attorney Erwin. May we proceed, Attorney Justin? Thank

01:52:51.550 --> 01:53:01.370
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: you, Your Honor. Ulitin ko po, sir, ano po yung meaning ng Certificate of Good Standing or what does that mean when the Board of Investment issues such certificate?

01:53:01.800 --> 01:53:12.700
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: That it is compliant with the specific terms and conditions at saka po dun sa mga hinihingi po nating reports from the company.

01:53:13.760 --> 01:53:23.260
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And tanong lang po, would the Board of Investments issue a certificate of good standing to an implausible business model, sir?

01:53:26.470 --> 01:53:32.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ano pong ibig sabihin ng... In the context nung sinabi niyo po ng implausible business model.

01:53:32.550 --> 01:53:35.930
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Just as it is, sir. As you understand the term that I just said, sir.

01:53:36.150 --> 01:53:54.070
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa pagkakaintindi ko lang po dito, inisuan po siya on the basis nung kanyang commitments po sa amin. As to whether that is referring to implausible or not implausible, I apologize. Hindi ko masasagot.

01:53:54.150 --> 01:54:13.690
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Let's move on sir. One of the documents that you submitted as well is a Board of Investments Travel Order No. 2026-168 dated April 28, 2026. Can you please explain to us sir what the relevance of this document is and why you submitted this to the court?

01:54:13.850 --> 01:54:29.860
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, kasi po in connection dun po sa request po ng kumpanya for Certificate of Good Standing, binisita rin po siya Nung aming legal and compliance service. So pinuntahan niya po yung firm na ito.

01:54:30.160 --> 01:54:34.140
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now what is the importance of visiting the firm sir in relation to that?

01:54:34.380 --> 01:55:14.380
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo. Para po makita talaga kung ano yung estado tapos matanong din po siya. Lalo na po dito dahil po nung nagdo-documentary check po tayo nakita po natin na bumaba yung employment na nireport po niya. Dun sa ating S-1 from I think 200 noong previous year. Mga nasa 200 po siya noong 2024 po yata eh. Tapos bumaba po to 50 or 51 the following year. So gusto lang po makita talaga ng ating mga compliance officers at matanong kung bakit po bumaba.

01:55:14.540 --> 01:55:15.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Sa B.O.I. travel...

01:55:17.430 --> 01:55:32.950
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you sir. Sa BOI travel order naman sir, it states that sa purpose of travel, it states the travel for the purpose of the verification of status and operations. How is this related to the one that you explained sir to confirm the operations of the business?

01:55:33.450 --> 01:55:40.070
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para makita po nila yung actual na estado, makausap yung mga tao po na involved.

01:55:41.290 --> 01:55:44.710
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Bakit kailangan ng travel orders yung mga tauhan ng ating board of investment?

01:55:44.710 --> 01:55:50.210
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi po galing po sila sa Manila at pupunta po sila. May mga galing po dito sa Manila.

01:55:51.300 --> 01:56:06.570
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So, okay. Next, sir. Let's go to the next document. You also submitted to this impeachment court a board of investment report on site inspection dated May 18, 2026, sir. Do you confirm submitting that document, sir?

01:56:06.870 --> 01:56:07.690
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes, po.

01:56:08.030 --> 01:56:16.010
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now... What is this plant inspection report, sir? Can you please elaborate to us what this document is?

01:56:16.210 --> 01:56:25.430
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung in relation po dun sa travel order. So, binisita na po nila tapos po ito po yung report nung naging pagbisita po nila.

01:56:26.650 --> 01:56:36.870
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, on the document, it states under attendees to the plant inspection, quote-unquote, BOILCS. What does that mean, sir?

01:56:37.270 --> 01:56:39.230
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Legal and Compliance Service po.

01:56:39.520 --> 01:56:48.320
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, meron pong mga pangalan under that table. Si Atty. Elyjean DC Portoza and etc. Sino po ito, sir?

01:56:50.260 --> 01:56:52.980
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya po yung Director ng Legal and Compliance Service.

01:56:52.980 --> 01:56:55.800
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At bakit po nakalagay yung pangalan niya sa report na yan?

01:56:56.020 --> 01:57:00.020
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya po yung pumunta dun sa kasama niya po yung dalawa pang tao.

01:57:00.160 --> 01:57:06.080
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, sa baba na table, sir, meron ding nakalabel na CFC. Ano pong ibig sabihin yan, sir?

01:57:07.560 --> 01:57:09.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: CALE88 Foods Corporation.

01:57:09.880 --> 01:57:15.220
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. At sino naman po ang mga pangalan na nakalagay sa baba, sir? Sino po sila?

01:57:15.440 --> 01:57:25.300
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito na po yung mga bagong may-ari, bagong presidente nung CALE88 Foods Corporation.

01:57:25.780 --> 01:57:30.120
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sorry, sir. Pakuulit po yung sinabi nyo. Sino po ito sila? Sorry.

01:57:31.300 --> 01:57:57.380
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya po niyang, ito pong si Lolita Paimalan, Chris Chu. Tsaka si Leo Sacurom. Ito na po yung mga bagong mga opisyalis ng CALE88 na okay lang ho ba. Nung pagpunta ko kasi natin doon, doon po natin alaman din na nagbago na pala ng may-ari po yung CALE88.

01:57:59.340 --> 01:58:19.730
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito na po yung mga bagong yun. Kaya po sinabihan din natin sila na oh kung nagbago kayo ng may-ari, kayo na pala. Meron kaming requirement din po na kailangan i-inform niyo ang BOI ng change in beneficial ownership. So may mga form din po ron, may proseso din po para ma-reflect din po natin sa records natin.

01:58:20.010 --> 01:58:29.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sir, balikan lang natin yung naunang table which is under BOI-LCS. In number two, who is Ms. Lorna D. Garcia, sir?

01:58:30.370 --> 01:58:36.470
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Taga Manila po namin ito na isa sa mga specialist po natin sa BOI.

01:58:37.350 --> 01:58:39.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is her designation sir?

01:58:39.410 --> 01:58:41.610
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Senior investment specialist po.

01:58:41.950 --> 01:58:49.850
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is the importance of a senior investment specialist attending in that plant inspection sir?

01:58:50.190 --> 01:58:58.310
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya rin po yung nakakaalam ng proyekto. Familiar po siya dun sa mga dokumento po in addition dun po sa ating Davao.

01:59:00.510 --> 01:59:02.490
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: BOI Extension Office. And

01:59:02.490 --> 01:59:04.850
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: what is her division, sir, as stated in that document?

01:59:05.070 --> 01:59:07.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Division B, Compliance Division B.

01:59:07.810 --> 01:59:15.470
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Next, sir, it also states a Ms. Marian Gay U. Liwanag. Who is this person, sir?

01:59:15.990 --> 01:59:22.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Isa din po siyang empleyado ng BOI under the Legal and Compliance Service Division.

01:59:22.650 --> 01:59:26.450
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And from what office of the Board of Investment, sir?

01:59:26.690 --> 01:59:30.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yun po. Compliance Service Division po. Compliance Division.

01:59:30.680 --> 01:59:32.320
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And where is that office located, sir?

01:59:32.400 --> 01:59:33.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa Manila po.

01:59:33.800 --> 01:59:43.640
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. And what is her... It states there investment specialist, sir. What is the importance of an investment specialist in a plant inspection, sir?

01:59:43.980 --> 01:59:52.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ganon din po. Meron po siyang kaalaman doon sa mga requirements ni BOI at saka po, yun, sa mga requirements ni BOI.

01:59:52.700 --> 02:00:01.440
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now... Balikan natin si Atty. Elyjean DC Portoza. Sir, sinabi niyo po, Director of Legal and Compliance. Where is her office, sir?

02:00:01.660 --> 02:00:02.460
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa Manila po.

02:00:02.840 --> 02:00:07.720
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. So, just to emphasize and conclude on this point, ang lahat na nag-inspect, taga-Maynila po?

02:00:07.940 --> 02:00:08.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Taga-Mainila.

02:00:09.080 --> 02:00:10.600
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Thank you, sir.

02:00:10.940 --> 02:00:15.880
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pwede po ba ako magtanong din kung may nakasamang taga-BIO sa aking mga kasamahan?

02:00:16.060 --> 02:00:16.920
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, I think.

02:00:22.280 --> 02:00:28.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: No need, Dr. Perry. The question was with respect to only the three people mentioned in the document. Salamat po.

02:00:29.140 --> 02:00:42.600
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Let's go to item number two of that same report, sir. Can you please read to us the finding under number 1, sir? As stated in the document. Can you please read it out loud, sir?

02:00:42.960 --> 02:01:05.060
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: During the inspection, the firm's compliance with its terms and conditions has been discussed, particularly its direct labor commitment. For 2025, which is year 3, the firm had to maintain direct labor of 39. Yun po kasi yung nakalagay dun sa kanyang specific terms and conditions na kinomit po sa atin sa gobyerno.

02:01:05.160 --> 02:01:05.580
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, sir.

02:01:05.700 --> 02:01:34.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So, but based on the 2025 BOI Form S-1, the firm had an actual labor of 50 while in 2024, they had reported 201. In response to the inquiry on the reduction of the number of labor from 2024 to 2025, the firm explained that it was attributable to a period of non-operation in 2025 due to the change in management and ownership.

02:01:35.440 --> 02:01:42.080
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: What was the response of the Board of Investment as stated on the paragraph after that, sir? Can you please read it out loud?

02:01:42.240 --> 02:02:02.980
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang sinabi po namin, noting the change in ownership, the LCS advised the firm to submit a request letter for said change, stating the reason therefore, Presenting the previous and current ownership structures and attaching relevant documents including the general information sheets before and after the change.

02:02:04.630 --> 02:02:17.730
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now sir, sinabi niyo po na may inspection and na-discuss po ang mga employee. What is the participation of the Board of Investments in respect to the assessment of the employees on the ground, sir?

02:02:18.350 --> 02:02:21.210
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: We rely po on the S-1 submission.

02:02:22.520 --> 02:02:32.560
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, in the ground inspection, sir, what do you find or what do you assess, sir, on the ground in the location itself of the project?

02:02:35.670 --> 02:02:46.330
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Biasi po dun sa report, tinitignan din po nila kung ano yung, kung nag-ooperate po ba. Hindi ko lang alam kung talagang binilang nila isa-isa na may 50 ngang tao na nandun.

02:02:46.730 --> 02:02:50.110
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Let's go to the finding number 3, sir.

02:02:51.640 --> 02:02:53.500
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Can you please discuss that, sir?

02:02:54.220 --> 02:03:05.040
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Finally, the LCS has reminded the firm on the timely submission of its annual reports, BOI Form S1, the annual financial statements, income tax return.

02:03:06.940 --> 02:03:18.620
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Otherwise, it would incur penalty. The LCS also advised the firm to use the new BOI Form S1. which may be downloaded from the BOI website.

02:03:18.860 --> 02:03:21.180
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: What is the importance of that finding in the inspection?

02:03:21.660 --> 02:03:31.210
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi po, kumisang nauhuli daw siya sa mga pag-submit niya ng mga report. Kaya kailangan natin silang i-remind na mag-submit ka on time.

02:03:31.690 --> 02:03:33.430
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Last on this document, sir.

02:03:35.060 --> 02:03:48.130
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At the last page of that document, there appears to be photographs as well. Can we please zoom in? We ask that the... Tech display, a clearer picture of that. What are these photos, sir, if you know?

02:03:48.490 --> 02:03:58.930
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung documentation na po na kinunan nung ating team nung bumisita po sila doon sa production facility ng CALE88.

02:04:00.490 --> 02:04:05.690
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And to clarify, sir, it's the Board of Investments team who took these photos, sir?

02:04:06.290 --> 02:04:12.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko alam kung kanino camera pero ang nag-attach po nito dito sa report ay yung team po namin.

02:04:13.040 --> 02:04:17.220
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what, can you please tell us what is this, what is shown in those photos?

02:04:17.560 --> 02:04:48.460
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I can only interpret based on what I see din po. Pero yan po, nakikita na meron po silang operation, tapos naka, this is a food company, naka, tawag doon, siguro parang gowns sila to ensure the Cleanliness. Tapos may nakita silang mga inventaryo dito po sa kumpanya. Mga saging.

02:04:50.490 --> 02:04:53.010
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tsaka may mga ongoing production po.

02:04:56.940 --> 02:05:00.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pero sir, ito under new management na itong sinasabi ko.

02:05:03.860 --> 02:05:13.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, may I just respectfully inquire if we still have time, Your Honor? I still have a few five pages in my direct examination, Your Honor.

02:05:14.780 --> 02:05:18.820
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Would this be a good time to pause, Attorney Justin? Or you want to consume the remaining four minutes?

02:05:19.280 --> 02:05:22.820
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: I prefer that we pause for the meantime, Your Honor, with the court's indulgence.

02:05:23.140 --> 02:05:27.420
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Okay. And you need approximately less than an hour when you resume?

02:05:27.700 --> 02:05:28.200
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor.

02:05:28.340 --> 02:05:31.100
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Okay. We shall pause for lunch.

02:05:33.160 --> 02:05:37.940
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Trial will resume at 1 p.m.

02:05:39.880 --> 02:05:40.600
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Trial is in recess.

03:09:21.300 --> 03:09:25.300
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Atty. Justin, you may proceed with your direct examination of the witness, Dr. Perry.

03:09:25.740 --> 03:10:00.310
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Before I proceed with my, continue with my direct examination, Your Honor, just a manifestation from the defense, Your Honor. There were changes in the markings with respect to prior markings such that the markings that were made during the marking sessions beyond the trial were different from those manifested. During the trial itself, Your Honor, we just request, Your Honor, that the markings done before the Clerk of Court be adopted, Your Honor. Just for the record, Your Honor.

03:10:00.850 --> 03:10:01.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Duly noted.

03:10:01.830 --> 03:10:04.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Your Honor. Continuing with my direct examination.

03:10:04.190 --> 03:10:05.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may proceed, Sir.

03:10:09.180 --> 03:10:27.490
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Magandang hapon po. Good afternoon, Sir. Sir, let's go to one of the documents that you submitted before this impeachment court. That would be the endorsement of good standing. From the Board of Investments to the Bureau of Customs, sir. Do you have that document, sir?

03:10:33.170 --> 03:10:33.470
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo.

03:10:34.590 --> 03:10:49.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, sir. Now, can you please tell us what this letter is all about, sir? Specifically, why the Board of Investments needed to send this letter to the Bureau of Customs in relation, of course, to CALE88 Foods Corporation?

03:10:50.540 --> 03:11:15.980
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nag-request po si CALE88 nitong certification na to para makapag-register siya dun sa client profile registration system ng Bureau of Customs. Tapos po tinignan natin yung kanyang record kaya po ang sinabi natin dito the firm is compliant with the terms and conditions of its registration kaya hence it is of good standing.

03:11:16.340 --> 03:11:19.660
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, thank you sir. Now my question sir is

03:11:21.240 --> 03:11:27.310
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Excuse me. Why did the Board of Investment send it directly to the Bureau of Customs, sir?

03:11:28.680 --> 03:11:34.040
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ganon po talaga yung proseso po natin na kailangan sila yung sa kanila po ipadala.

03:11:35.020 --> 03:11:39.040
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Can we please go to the bottom portion of that, the same letter, please?

03:11:42.100 --> 03:11:57.460
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Letter, sir. It appears to be signed by Atty. Elyjean DC Portoza, sir. How is that person related to the person who conducted the site inspection in CALE88 Foods Corporation, sir, in Tagum, Davao?

03:11:57.580 --> 03:12:04.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Siya din po ang nag-site inspection. Pero hindi naman po talaga kailangan na siya rin yung nagkataon lang po ito.

03:12:04.800 --> 03:12:05.520
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir.

03:12:07.470 --> 03:12:40.470
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now sir, if you recall, there were findings in the BOI site inspection, yung mga diniscuss po natin. And that report was dated May 18, 2026. We also have now an endorsement of good standing dated June 16, 2026. How do you reconcile the issuance of both documents, sir? On one hand, we have a BOI site inspection report. Making findings in relation to CALE88 Foods Corporation's operation and on the other.

03:12:42.790 --> 03:12:47.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Nonetheless, the BOI issued an endorsement of good standing dated June 16, 2026.

03:12:49.310 --> 03:13:32.950
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Consistent pa rin naman po dahil ang tinignan po natin dito ay yung mga nakalagay sa specific terms and conditions. Number one po halimbawa yung kanyang Labor na sinasabi. Tapos po nakita naman po natin base dun sa S-1 niya. Ang pagpunta po dun, ito pong Certificate of Good Standing, hindi lang po ito base dun sa actual inspection. Kasama din po dito yung pag-review ng kanyang mga documentary requirements at saka yung pong nilagay niyang mga information dun. Nakita naman po natin na compliant pa rin po siya base po dun sa mga sinubmit po niya. Kaya po nag-issue tayo nitong Certificate of Good Standing.

03:13:33.310 --> 03:13:53.240
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. One of the documents you also submitted before this impeachment court is a Certificate of Income Tax Holiday Incentive or CETI dated April 22, 2026. Do you have it with you now, sir? April 22, 2025, rather.

03:14:01.200 --> 03:14:04.380
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Certificate of Entitlement to Tax Incentives.

03:14:04.540 --> 03:14:07.780
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Can you please tell us sir for the record when this was issued?

03:14:08.460 --> 03:14:14.930
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: It was issued on April 22, 2025.

03:14:15.650 --> 03:14:19.890
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And who issued that Certificate of Income Tax Holiday Incentives sir?

03:14:19.930 --> 03:14:22.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Si Director Elyjean Portoza po.

03:14:23.050 --> 03:14:27.970
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is his or her authority to issue said certificate sir?

03:14:28.550 --> 03:14:31.590
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: As the director of the legal and compliance service.

03:14:32.110 --> 03:14:42.270
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: May we also request that it be flashed on the screen? Now my question sir, can you please explain to us what this document or what the purpose of this document is?

03:14:44.010 --> 03:15:33.690
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pagka po kasi magfafile ng income tax return ang isang registered business enterprise, sinasama niya po ito. Naka-attach po ito dun sa ITR. Kasi po di ba pag nag-submit kayo ng income tax return sa BIR, dapat dun meron na nakalagay na nagbayad kayo. Tapos may bank receipt na nagbayad kayo. So in lieu of that po, ito yung ilalagay niya. Para ma-indicate na hindi pa ako nagbayad kasi entitled ako to tax incentives. Tapos magko-compute po ngayon sila. Babalik ko yun sa amin tapos mag-i-issue po kami ng another endorsement naman of the tax incentives na i-dedicate naman po nila doon sa kanilang isasubmit sa BIR.

03:15:33.970 --> 03:15:43.410
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And this is confirmatory sir. Evidensya lang po ito para to prove na hindi po kailangan magbayad ng tax yung kumpanya. And in this case, CALE88 Foods Corporation.

03:15:44.290 --> 03:15:53.270
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pero ito, ano lang ito, certification. Hindi pa ito'y nakalagay kung magkano yung kanyang hindi dapat bayaran. May isang proseso pa po doon.

03:15:53.910 --> 03:16:21.070
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, one of the documents that you submitted earlier is the certificate of registration, di ba? Natalakay na po natin. Ano ang relasyon dyan ng certificate of registration? Enterprise Number 2021-1-86 at nung Certificate of Income Tax Holiday Incentive dated April 22, 2025 na tinalakay lang po natin. What is the relationship of these two documents?

03:16:21.430 --> 03:16:48.490
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung nag-ooperationalize nung sa Certificate of Registration po naka-enumerate doon yung mga incentives na available para sa kanya. Yung letter A po ay income tax holiday for 6 years. So ito po sinasabi lang na oh, itong kumpanya to ay registered sa amin tapos entitled siya to tax incentives.

03:16:49.290 --> 03:17:31.080
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, another set of documents that the Board of Investments submitted to this impeachment court is a letter request for change in ownership dated July 8, 2026. We request that it be flashed with attachments. of CALE88 Foods Corporation's General Information Sheet in the year 2024 and CALE88 Foods Corporation's General Information Sheet in the year 2025. Can we just zoom in please on the portions? Sir, if you know what is this letter all about sir, can you please tell us?

03:17:31.570 --> 03:17:53.770
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung maalala niyo po doon po sa site inspection report, nalaman din po ng BOI na iba na ho yung may-ari ng CALE88. Kaya po pinayuhan natin sila na you are required to submit the new ownership to BOI.

03:17:54.710 --> 03:18:06.610
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir. So in short sir, what is the relationship of this letter to the earlier Board of Investment Report on Site Inspection dated May 18, 2026. To be specific, sir.

03:18:07.190 --> 03:18:19.730
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung sagot nila doon sa ating pagpayo sa kanila, meaning si CALE88, na kailangan ninyong i-reflect sa records na amin na kayo na yung bagong owners ng CALE88.

03:18:20.830 --> 03:18:47.660
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is the relevance in the submission that you made before this impeachment, sir? There are attachments which are the 2024 General Information Sheet. and 2025 General Information Sheet of CALE88 Foods Corporation. What is the relevance of those SEC documents in relation to this letter request for change in ownership dated July 8, 2026, if any, sir? Yun

03:18:47.660 --> 03:19:09.940
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: po ay yung sa GIS po, eto yung mga nagre-reflect naman nung nasa SEC ay na-transfer na po, na-reflect na po dun sa kanyang incorporation na Sila na po yung bagong owners. So, iyon po yung patunay na kailangan nilang i-attach dun sa letter nila para iyon po yung pagbasehan namin na iba na nga yung may-ari nitong CALE88.

03:19:10.220 --> 03:19:27.790
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And can we please go to the signature page of that letter? And in the document that you have with you now, sir, and that appearing on screen, who is the person who signed the letter on behalf of CALE88 Foods Corporation, sir?

03:19:28.300 --> 03:20:05.910
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Dito po kung titignan po natin doon sa capital structure annex B naka-attach po dito sa letter din nila ng July 8. Ito pong si Lolita Paimalan. Sana po yung nakalagay na may ownership ng 5% CALE88. Tapos tignan ko lang ako ng reflect dun sa GIS. Alam ko siya na yung presidente ng CALE88.

03:20:06.150 --> 03:20:13.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And before siya sir, sino po ang base sa mga documents na sinumiti ng CALE88 Foods Corporation?

03:20:16.300 --> 03:20:18.160
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Particularly in the year 2024.

03:20:19.040 --> 03:20:24.800
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I-check ko lang ko kung si Manases Carpio o kung si Lourdes Lemusada.

03:20:25.300 --> 03:20:26.620
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes sir. Please do sir.

03:20:51.580 --> 03:21:00.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa GIS po ay si, ng 2024 ay si Manases R. Carpio yung presidente po.

03:21:00.600 --> 03:21:05.080
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At sino po ba ang iba na mga officers ng kumpanya?

03:21:05.180 --> 03:21:16.040
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Si Lourdes Lebosada po ang tumatay yung treasurer. Tapos si Myrie Ellenniel Leaño ang corporate secretary po.

03:21:16.120 --> 03:21:19.880
