03:21:54.250 --> 03:22:07.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Puntaan po natin yung 2025 sir. Sino po yung stockholders ng CALE88 Foods Corporation sa 2025 general information sheet na isinumite ng kumpanya sa Board of Investments?

03:22:21.190 --> 03:22:28.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito na po si Ian C. Neo, COS.

03:22:33.760 --> 03:22:39.240
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tapos po Lolita Paimalan, President-Treasurer.

03:22:39.660 --> 03:22:47.990
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay po. Punta natin yung stockholding sir. Ano po yung stockholding sa taon na yan? Yung 2025 general information.

03:22:48.330 --> 03:22:56.770
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Si Lolita Paimalan po ay 5%. Tapos po si... Piki mong Philippines ay 95%.

03:22:56.770 --> 03:23:06.990
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, sir. And again, sir, para lang for the record, bakit po kailangan mag-send ng letter na ito sa Board of Investments?

03:23:07.870 --> 03:23:27.130
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Talaga pong nire-require namin para malaman namin kung sino yung beneficial ownership. Although, mas importante ito dun sa mga sectors na merong Restriction sa foreign equity. Kaya mas kailangan namin yan.

03:23:27.370 --> 03:23:38.190
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At dito naman po sir, kung alam niyo po sa Export Enterprise na in-issue ng BOI sa CALE, 88 Foods Corporation, meron po bang restrictions on foreign equity?

03:23:38.510 --> 03:23:38.950
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

03:23:39.190 --> 03:23:39.830
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now,

03:23:40.530 --> 03:24:01.740
