03:24:02.160 --> 03:24:02.880
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Oo po.

03:24:03.000 --> 03:24:13.720
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And what is the relationship of this letter, sir, to the earlier request or letter sent by CALE88 Foods Corporation for change of ownership, if any, sir?

03:24:13.940 --> 03:24:37.070
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito na po yung... nag... Approved. Teka lang. Evaluation. Noting. Noting the change in ownership undertaken by the following persons from Kila Carpio, Lebosada, and Leaño to Paimalan and Pikimong-Pikimong Corporation.

03:24:38.980 --> 03:24:45.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So nasa records na po. Ninote na po natin at ito na po yung nasa records ni BOI ngayon na new owners nun po.

03:24:45.560 --> 03:25:01.140
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, sir. Puntahan naman natin, sir, yung... Letter dated November 20, 2026 na you submitted to the impeachment court, sir. These are the new set of documents, sir. I just have a few questions in relation to these documents, sir.

03:25:02.930 --> 03:25:12.050
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Sir, bakit po ba na, ano po yung reason or what is the reason why you had to submit these additional documents, sir?

03:25:12.270 --> 03:25:35.680
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito lang po yung mga supporting documents related dun sa Certificate of Registration nung una po silang nag-apply para po kumpleto. Ito po yung mga internal na documents na nasa amin po in relation doon sa approval ng application po nila tsaka pag-issue ng Certificate of Registration.

03:25:36.040 --> 03:25:44.020
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And this is just confirmatory sir. You're saying that ito po yung mga sinubmit nila sa application process nila to be issued the Certificate of Registration.

03:25:44.430 --> 03:25:45.930
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Would that be correct, sir?

03:25:46.050 --> 03:26:01.990
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi lang po. Kasi po, limbawa itong una, memo request for the printing of certificate of registration. Internal po ito sa amin. So, internal request po noong director na o i-print na tapos para mapirmahan na po.

03:26:02.110 --> 03:26:14.760
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: So, just in general, sir, please explain. Documents 1 to 18. What relation does this have to CALE88 Foods Corporation and its registration with the Board of Investments?

03:26:14.780 --> 03:26:53.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So ito po yung mga dokumento na either in support po noon sa application ni CALE88. o kaya po kasama din po dito yung kanilang mga affidavit, kasama din po dito yung kanilang halimbawa dito at the very beginning kasi kailangan sabihin nila sa BOI kung ano yung pinipili nilang incentive. Halimbawa SCIT ba yan o enhanced deduction. May mga ganun kasi silang choices. So, ito yung mga dokumento na sinubmit nila in relation to their acceptance at saka pag-issue namin nung kanilang registration.

03:26:54.460 --> 03:28:46.470
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay, sir. Now, nag-aral po kasi ako tungkol sa BOI at sa structure ng ating government institution. I note that under Chapter 2, Article 7 of Executive Order 226, The Omnibus Investments Code of 1987, the Board of Investment has the following powers. Number 7, periodically check and verify the compliance by registered enterprises with the relevant provisions of this code, with the rules and regulations promulgated under this code, and with the terms and conditions of registration. The next power, or subparagraph 8, after due notice, the Board of Investment has the power to, after due notice, Cancel the registration or suspend the enjoyment of incentives, benefits of any registered enterprise, and or require refund of incentives enjoyed by such enterprise, including interest and monetary penalties for a. failure to maintain the qualifications required by this Code for registration with the Board and b. for violation of any provision of this Code of the Rules and Regulations issued under this Code. of the terms and conditions of registration or of loss for the protection of labor or the consuming public. There is a proviso after that. But I will not ask you about the provision of the law sir. My specific question to the Board of Investment is this. Given the several documents that were submitted by CALE88 Foods Corporation, the course of its application, registration, and even to this date 2026 or from 2021, to 2026. What cancellation of registration did the Board of Investments do to CALE88 Foods Corporation, if any?

03:28:46.890 --> 03:28:53.470
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po kami on record na in-issue na about cancellation ng registration nila.

03:28:53.650 --> 03:29:10.100
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: How about the suspension of enjoyment of incentives? What suspension did the Board of Investments issue in relation to CALE88 Foods Corporation from 2021? It's start of operation January 1, 2023 to the present.

03:29:10.380 --> 03:29:11.040
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

03:29:11.240 --> 03:29:13.120
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: No further questions for direct, Your Honor.

