03:31:11.890 --> 03:31:28.390
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Personally, kayo po hindi nyo alam. Thank you. Puntahan natin yung report on actual date of start of commercial operations, initial investments and employment, which is letter C nung...

03:31:31.650 --> 03:31:35.350
