03:34:01.840 --> 03:34:12.000
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So ganun ka-important po yung report na yan. Actually, andito na po yung sa primer na nababangkit ko kanina. Pakibasa ko, pa-confirm po kung tama, accurate ba yan, yung nasa primer ng BOI.

03:34:25.190 --> 03:34:26.770
