Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Basically, yung 95% combined shareholding ni Dr. Lebosada at Atty. Manases Carpio, na nakalista sa 2024 GIS. Sa 2025 GIS, nawala na ko yung names nila at pumalit po itong Pikimong Pikimong Philippines Corporation.

04:03:46.640 --> 04:03:47.480
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pama po.

04:03:47.580 --> 04:04:01.130
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Owning 95% as well. Tingnan nga po natin yung July 8, 2026 letter na naka-attach sa November

04:04:02.700 --> 04:04:07.760
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: 18 letter ninyo. Yung letter, ah, sorry, it's annexed.

04:04:11.800 --> 04:04:48.720
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: It's labeled kasi as a letter request. Pero I've read the letter. Pakilinaw nga lang po, ano ko ba talagang nire-request dito sa letter na ito? Are they requesting for a congratulations dahil nalipat na yung kumpanya? Are they requesting for approval? Pero pagkabasa po kasi natin, it's prior. I mean, they should ask. For that before. Pero ito po nangyari na after, tama po ba? July 8. Natapos na po yung supposed transfer. Tama po ba yun?

04:04:50.260 --> 04:05:07.670
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: And July 8, third day na po ito nung impeachment trial natin sa court. So, confirm ko lang po. Wala akong nababasa na request po sa letter. Kayo po ba meron?

04:05:07.930 --> 04:05:13.910
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po. Updating po ito nang ini-inform po tayo to update their records na iba na po yung may-ari.

04:05:14.010 --> 04:05:17.790
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So hindi po siya talaga request? Kung baga FYI lang pala sa BOI?

04:05:17.990 --> 04:05:18.410
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

04:05:18.550 --> 04:05:29.700
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay lang. Alright. Thank you. Okay lang po yan. And then tignan naman natin tong response ng BOI dated October 9, 2026.

04:05:32.250 --> 04:05:34.970
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Naka-label po kasi sa transmittal ninyo

04:05:34.970 --> 04:05:52.080
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: na ito ay letter of approval of the request for change in ownership. And I'm reading the letter po. Wala po akong nababasa na salitang approved eh. Narinig ko po kayo kanina, kinorrect nyo pa nga po. I believe you said the word note.

04:05:52.700 --> 04:05:56.100
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala pong approval dito. Wala pong approval. Note po. We are noting.

04:05:56.400 --> 04:06:03.860
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so hindi po in-approve. Wala pong approval. Yes or no lang po ha? Wala pong approval dun sa change in ownership?

04:06:04.580 --> 04:06:05.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Note lang po.

04:06:05.700 --> 04:06:07.540
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So the answer is wala.

04:06:07.640 --> 04:06:08.180
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

04:06:08.260 --> 04:06:08.820
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, thank you.

04:06:16.650 --> 04:06:21.830
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sir, alam niyo po ba na mahiling magtanim ng mga puno si Vice President Sara Duterte?

04:06:22.710 --> 04:06:24.150
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. What's the relevance?

04:06:24.770 --> 04:06:31.810
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Andito po yung pitch. I have a point, Your Honor. I promise. Put me on a short leash. Your Honor,

04:06:31.850 --> 04:06:35.630
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: unless there is relevance, Your Honor, we ask that this be taken down.

04:06:35.790 --> 04:06:37.830
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: My next question will show the relevance.

04:06:38.250 --> 04:06:39.790
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Erwin, you're on a short leash.

04:06:39.890 --> 04:07:05.320
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you, Your Honor. Tama po ba na itong pagtatanim ng mga punin ni Vice President Saro Duterte ay connected sa pag-comply ng Cale88 Foods sa tree planting activities na requirement ng Board of Investment. In fact, ang requirement mo ng Board of Investments ay magtanim dapat ang mga enterprises ng at least 100 forest trees. May ganong requirement? Tama po ba?

04:07:05.380 --> 04:07:32.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. Misleading. There is no prior testimony coming from the witness wherein he testified that the Vice President participated in the compliance requirement of tree planting. The insinuation being made by the prosecution that the pictures being shown or that was displayed of the Vice President planting trees had any relation to the Cale88 Foods Corporation's registration is misleading, malicious, and callous, Your Honor.

04:07:32.970 --> 04:07:36.650
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I will have to sustain the objection on your question, Attorney Erwin. Move on.

04:07:36.790 --> 04:07:41.870
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, Your Honor. So, may compliance po ba itong Cale88 Foods sa tree planting activities?

04:07:42.470 --> 04:08:01.170
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I'll have to check po dun sa specific terms and conditions kung nakalagay po yung sa tree planting. Pero sa pagkakaalam ko po... Kasama po ito sa mga nire-require ng BOI. Pero may time period po for them to, sa pagkakaalala ko po, may time period for them to also comply. I -check ko lang po.

04:08:01.270 --> 04:08:08.570
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, i-lead ko po kayo sa requirement. It's actually in 7D of the general terms and conditions.

04:08:12.980 --> 04:08:13.800
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nakita ko na po.

04:08:14.040 --> 04:08:18.930
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nakita nyo na po. So, ano po yung nakalagay dyan?

04:08:19.260 --> 04:08:45.160
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Comply with the tree planting program of the board requiring a minimum of 100 forest trees to be planted pursuant to memorandum circular number one not later than one year from date of registration. Proof of compliance must be submitted within one year from date of registration. Otherwise, application for availment of any incentive by the enterprise shall not be accepted by the board.

04:08:48.590 --> 04:08:57.250
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Wala po kayo sa mga tree planting activities ng Cale88 Foods? Kung may nangyari man po na ganun? Wala po kayo na -witness na ganun?

04:08:58.030 --> 04:08:58.810
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

04:08:58.930 --> 04:09:07.390
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So personally, hindi nyo po masabi kung nakapag-comply itong Cale88 dun sa required tree planting of 100, at least 100 forest trees?

04:09:07.470 --> 04:09:19.700
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Personally po, wala. Pero pwede ko pong i-check kung nag-submit po sila ng notarized na statement na nag-comply po sila. Sa compliance po namin.

04:09:19.820 --> 04:09:23.060
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Wala po ako nakikita sa files niyo na gano'n eh. Wala pong nakasama.

04:09:23.060 --> 04:09:24.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I can check din po.

04:09:24.480 --> 04:09:25.080
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Thank you.

04:09:27.630 --> 04:09:45.490
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi din po, hindi sila nag-avail ng income tax holiday prior to availment of ITH. Doon po yan na check-check talaga. Nababangga po pagka nag-avail sila ng ITH, ng duty exemption, at saka po ng SCIT.

04:09:45.790 --> 04:09:54.800
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Alright. Sige, tignan natin yung application process nitong Cale88.

04:10:08.420 --> 04:10:24.300
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Nabasa ko po sa primer ninyo na pag may mga applications po, ang inoobserve nyo po ay first in, first out basis in processing the applications for registration.

04:10:25.140 --> 04:10:27.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tama po. Doon sa primer po.

04:10:28.050 --> 04:10:49.000
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. And nakalagay po sa primer ninyo na due to the volume of applications, firms shall receive a notification of the board's action on their ITH applications approximately within one year from the date of official acceptance. So pwedeng maging ganun po yung period up to one year based dito sa primer ninyo.

04:10:49.000 --> 04:10:52.400
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Patignan ko ha ulit kung ano yung...

04:10:52.820 --> 04:10:55.180
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ito pong sa primer po.

04:11:20.170 --> 04:11:25.170
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I thought I heard you, Dr. Perry, that Cale88 did not apply for ITH.

04:11:25.290 --> 04:11:27.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po siya nag-apply, Honorable Judge.

04:11:28.170 --> 04:11:29.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: What's the relevance, Attorney Erwin?

04:11:33.010 --> 04:11:34.550
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: I'm just...

04:11:34.550 --> 04:11:41.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: He did not apply for ITH. He was not given ITH. So what's the connection of this provision?

04:11:42.540 --> 04:11:56.300
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: With regard to the... I just want the witness to confirm that there are a lot of applications with the BOI. And it takes time for them to process. These documents, Your Honor, these applications.

04:11:56.860 --> 04:12:02.740
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: But this refers to ITH. The witness already said they did not apply for ITH. They were not given ITH.

04:12:02.860 --> 04:12:12.860
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, Your Honor. And when it comes to applications in general and not just ITH, Your Honor, inclusive of registration, Your Honor,

04:12:14.980 --> 04:12:24.020
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: as to the length of time that it may take time in... Processing the applications for registrations, Your Honor.

04:12:24.260 --> 04:12:27.520
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. May we ask now the relevance of this line of questioning?

04:12:27.720 --> 04:12:32.720
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, that's exactly what I'm asking, Atty. Erwin. What's the relevance of this too?

04:12:33.040 --> 04:12:38.720
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Then I'll go directly to the point and not dwell on this ITH application, Your Honor.

04:12:38.840 --> 04:12:39.300
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, please.

04:12:39.780 --> 04:12:52.090
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sa ITH application kasi first in, first out basis. How about in any other application, like application for business... Registration. Same po ba?

04:12:52.310 --> 04:12:58.890
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: As much as possible po, we are following kung sino po yung nauna. Para fair lang naman po.

04:12:59.090 --> 04:13:04.170
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. Kung sino po yung nauna. At in your experience, gaano po kakahaba usually yung period?

04:13:04.490 --> 04:13:28.720
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron po kaming citizens charter na required po kami pagka po upon submission of sa registration po. Upon submission of complete documents, pag tinanggap na po namin siya for checklisting, we are required to process within 20 days from the time of application for registration.

04:13:30.280 --> 04:13:47.630
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pagkatapos po, doon naman po pag MSME, required po kami to process within 3 days po. Sa registration po yan, magkakaiba ko kasi yung registration sa Of course, ITH Availment.

04:13:47.910 --> 04:13:52.010
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pero realistically speaking, nasusunod po ba yung 20 days?

04:13:52.150 --> 04:13:59.890
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: As much as possible po, we try to keep to kung ano po yung nasa citizen's charter po natin.

04:14:00.190 --> 04:14:06.910
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. Let me just go into yung documents na nakatouch sa November 20 letter ninyo.

04:14:10.990 --> 04:14:16.330
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pakonfirm nga po na merong application for registration dated December 6, 2021.

04:14:19.820 --> 04:14:31.990
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Based po yun sa November 20, ano? Oo. Na sinubmit sa... December 7 pala po ito.

04:14:45.330 --> 04:14:50.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Application file December 6, number 11.

04:15:05.340 --> 04:15:09.820
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Naka -label siya ng Exhibit 1.

04:15:09.820 --> 04:15:15.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Application for registration, December 6, using yung BOI form po for small enterprise projects.

04:15:15.480 --> 04:15:23.600
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, December 6 po, ano? Kanina po, pinakita sa inyo yung online notice of publication.

04:15:25.720 --> 04:15:37.100
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At pinost po, sabi niya po, hindi na kailangan mag-publish in a newspaper of general circulation para hindi na gumastos. So online po yung naging posting dito.

04:15:39.160 --> 04:16:16.890
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: And you confirm po na, pinakita po kasi sa inyo kanina, nakita ko po yung date na finlash sa screen when Attorney Gular was doing his direct examination, December 6. 2021 na post yung notice na ito. And then based on notice na ito, binigyan po yung public ng three days to file their opposition or objection. Tama po ba? Pero kung titignan po natin, mayroon ng by December 7, may approval ang Davao

04:16:19.670 --> 04:16:35.160
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: office ng BOI. Ito po yung third document. dun sa November 20, 2026. Sorry, it's the second document. It's the final compliance.

04:16:40.240 --> 04:17:02.230
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: It's the final compliance with prerequisites for issuance of certificate of registration. Nakalagay po na may date of approval by the division chief ng December 7, 2021. Tama po. Can you verbalize your answer po? Tama po ba? December 7, may approval na ang Davao City Division Chief.

04:17:02.550 --> 04:17:03.050
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

04:17:03.730 --> 04:17:22.610
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: In fact, may letter na rin po na sinend ang Division Chief ng Davao, si Mr. Gil M. Dureza, dated December 7, 2021, kay Dr. Lourdes Lebosada. Based po sa document...

04:17:24.300 --> 04:17:28.100
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: It's the third document in your November 20 transmittal.

04:17:30.360 --> 04:17:30.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

04:17:31.420 --> 04:18:20.230
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So nakalagay po dito sa letter, you can read it with me. Dear Dr. Lebosada, we are pleased to inform you that the Board, through the Board of Investments, Davao Extension Office, has approved your company's project on December 7, 2021. So this was a day after po nung... application form na December 6, 2021. So, when yung notice of, yung publication notice po, dated December 6. So, kung ako po, nag-oppose po ako by December 8, ano pong sasabihin ng BOI Davao sa akin na late na po ako dahil may lumalabas po na may approval na. Late po ba yung opposition ko? Am I on time or maaga pa po?

04:18:20.390 --> 04:18:51.940
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Para po kasi maging operational talaga yan, kailangan po siyang makareceive nung final approval from the board mismo. Yun po yung certificate of registration na tinatransmit po natin. So hindi pa po... Yun po, approved at the level ng ating BEO, yung Division Chief. Pero pagka po meron pang, ang importante po, hindi pa namin i-issue po yung Certificate of Registration po natin.

04:18:52.080 --> 04:18:55.700
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At kailangan po yun ng action ng Board of Investment mismo?

04:18:56.840 --> 04:19:16.520
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Una-una po, pagka po kasi ginawa yun ng Division Chief, ini- Kagaya po nasabi ko kanina, iniipon po lahat ng mga MSME application tapos sinasabay-sabay sila para inote ng board every first meeting of the month.

04:19:17.340 --> 04:19:23.160
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Do you remember po kung kailan yung first meeting of the month nung December 2021?

04:19:23.960 --> 04:19:26.180
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko na ako maalala eh.

04:19:28.600 --> 04:19:32.060
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pwede ko pong tignan yung records po kung kailan siya.

04:19:34.620 --> 04:19:44.220
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi pwede pong tumama yun ng ibang araw. Halimbawa walang quorum during the, naiiba-iba ho yung, although we try as much as possible na.

04:19:45.820 --> 04:19:52.800
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pero na-notice ko po na December 9, meron na pong DOI na from ano.

04:19:53.160 --> 04:19:54.540
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Certificate of Registration.

04:19:54.720 --> 04:20:02.780
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, December 9, 2021 is Thursday po. December 9, 2021. Thursday po yun.

04:20:03.830 --> 04:20:05.390
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po maalala.

04:20:05.510 --> 04:20:17.980
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Anyway, hindi pa rin po tapos yung 3-day period for the public to oppose. Kasi

04:20:17.980 --> 04:20:29.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: December 6 po na-publish. 6 po ba nakalagay po yung naka-post? 6, 7, 8, 9 po nilabas.

04:20:29.840 --> 04:20:32.540
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So for you po, kasama yung December 6 na?

04:20:32.600 --> 04:20:34.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, kasama po. Binilang na po.

04:20:34.560 --> 04:20:36.780
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Hindi nyo po alam kung anong oras pinublish ito?

04:20:36.900 --> 04:20:37.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po alam.

04:20:37.960 --> 04:20:40.320
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Hindi nyo alam. So pwede yung late, hindi afternoon na?

04:20:40.500 --> 04:20:41.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po alam.

04:20:41.540 --> 04:20:53.120
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Hindi nyo masabi. Anyway, just to ask, sino po yung mayor ng Davao City noong 2021? Alam nyo po ba?

04:20:54.140 --> 04:21:03.210
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi... Hindi ko po alam. Kung sino ang mayor ng Davao City noong 2021.

04:21:03.590 --> 04:21:03.890
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay.

04:21:34.690 --> 04:21:46.790
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. Kailangan po mag-submit ang registered business enterprises ng kanilang Articles of Incorporation sa BOI. Tama po ba?

04:21:49.540 --> 04:21:53.460
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasama po dun sa... Opo. Kasama po. Na-incorporate na po siya.

04:21:54.020 --> 04:21:57.400
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ipakita ko po sa inyo yung Articles of Incorporation ng Cale88.

04:22:01.950 --> 04:22:21.550
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ah, by the way, before this. Okay. Nabanggit niyo po yung board kanina. So minsan hindi natutuloy yung meeting ng board kasi walang quorum. 7 po ang members ng BOI. So ilan po dapat ang members para magka-quorum?

04:22:22.750 --> 04:22:23.570
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Majority lang po.

04:22:23.690 --> 04:22:31.650
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So dapat may 4 members na mag-attend para may quorum para mag-conduct ng business. Anong effect po pag walang quorum ang Board of Investments?

04:22:32.130 --> 04:22:34.410
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po valid yung action ng board.

04:22:34.650 --> 04:22:36.550
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Hindi makaka-act at all ang BOI?

04:22:36.550 --> 04:22:37.330
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po makaka-act.

04:22:37.650 --> 04:22:42.890
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So at least four, okay. Pakitingnan po yung Articles of Incorporation ng Cale88.

04:23:04.150 --> 04:23:12.670
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yung portion po na, yung number of Board of Directors, pakibasa po kung ilan ng Board of Directors dapat ng Cale88 Foods.

04:23:15.090 --> 04:23:26.310
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: That the number of directors of the corporation shall be six, and the names, nationalities, and residences of the first directors of the corporation are as follows.

04:23:29.200 --> 04:23:31.640
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, 6 po nakalagay dyan, no?

04:23:33.980 --> 04:23:34.700
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 6 po.

04:23:34.800 --> 04:23:46.920
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, kung ang BOI kailangan ng 4 out of 7 for quorum, ilan naman po sa Cale88 para magkaroon ng quorum? Kung 6 ang kanilang board members.

04:23:47.240 --> 04:24:11.470
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor, we will have to object on the ground of incompetence, Your Honor. I do not know why the prosecution is asking with all due respect. The internal processes of Cale88 Foods Corporation from a Board of Investments witness, Your Honor, on the basis of the requirement of quorum of the BOI. With all due respect, we think that's a stretch. We think it's outright irrelevant.

04:24:13.340 --> 04:24:37.170
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Erwin, you have to... With your indulgence... Before this witness testified, the Chair already said that your articles of impeachment merely make mention of Cale88 as one of the possible sources of monies of the Vice President. So whether it is actually engaged in business or not is of no moment. In fact, it proves your case, if at all, that

04:24:37.170 --> 04:24:39.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: it is a regular business as a source of possible

04:24:39.630 --> 04:24:49.220
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: revenue. Number two, your witness, Alex Cabrera, described it as a... What was the word, Attorney Justin?

04:24:49.700 --> 04:24:51.220
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Implausible business model.

04:24:51.240 --> 04:25:21.630
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Then you can prove that too, but whether you prove that or not, I find that a surplusage on the part, quite frankly, of Attorney Cabrera because he seeks to prove unexplained, undeclared income. And if this is an ongoing business, then the question is, dineclare ba o hindi nang tama? So, why are we nitpicking on... The BOI's official documents on file with their office.

04:25:22.130 --> 04:25:39.530
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Your Honor, I'm wrapping up and the relevance of this line of questioning goes into the capacity of this entity to conduct business. I will show later on how it's going to be relevant but I'd like to hear the answer. I have a point, Your Honor. I promise that it's going to be relevant, Your Honor.

04:25:39.630 --> 04:25:39.990
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, please.

04:25:40.310 --> 04:25:40.710
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Your Honor.

04:25:40.850 --> 04:25:54.110
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Then in that case, Attorney Justin, I think the key word is he's about to wrap up. On that assumption and premise, with your indulgence, Atty. Justin, I'll allow it. Yes.

04:25:54.750 --> 04:26:01.630
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po alam kung ano yung majority na required nila. Normally po, divided by 2 plus 1 yung alam ko po.

04:26:01.770 --> 04:26:05.090
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, apply po natin yung formula nyo. Divided by 2 plus 1 is what?

04:26:05.270 --> 04:26:06.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 4 po.

04:26:06.710 --> 04:26:13.590
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay. Gusto ko sanang ipakita sa inyong 2022 GIS pero object kan. So, diretso tayo sa 2024 GIS.

04:26:16.590 --> 04:26:19.650
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Tignan niyo po yung list of directors for the 2024 GIS.

04:26:26.600 --> 04:26:27.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tinitignan ko na po.

04:26:27.580 --> 04:26:28.940
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ilan po ang directors dyan?

04:26:29.600 --> 04:26:30.380
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tatlo po.

04:26:30.620 --> 04:26:33.660
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sure po kayo? Wala nang iba na lista? Tatlo lang?

04:26:34.340 --> 04:26:35.680
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, dito po tatlo.

04:26:36.080 --> 04:27:00.210
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So, less than four. And are you aware po na sa second amended pa lang ng 2022 GIS nitong kumpanyang to, tatlo rin yung directors nila? Aware po kayo doon? Aware po kayo na as early as dung filing nila ng 2022 amended GIS, tatlo lang din po yung nakalagay na board of directors.

04:27:00.510 --> 04:27:03.390
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po nakita yung 2022 GIS.

04:27:03.750 --> 04:27:05.530
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Sige, yung 2025, pakita ko po sa inyo.

04:27:07.930 --> 04:27:11.930
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Ilan po ang lumalabas na directors? Nito pong Cale88,

04:27:12.110 --> 04:27:12.550
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: dalawa po.

04:27:12.590 --> 04:27:24.250
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Yes, dalawa na lang. So lalong mababa pa sa 4. So kanina nabanggit nyo, hindi makakapag-conduct ng business ang BOI kung walang quorum. Is it the same for companies?

04:27:24.970 --> 04:27:31.770
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Objection, Your Honor. Misleading. But number two, Your Honor, if I may. I thought he was winding up, Your Honor.

04:27:31.830 --> 04:27:42.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: He already withdrew the question, counsel. Again, it is misleading because they vote based on their shareholdings in the company and the law already allows an OPC. Anyway, Attorney Erwin.

04:27:42.790 --> 04:28:01.860
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Just last few questions. Balikan po natin yung mga affidavits na inattach ni Lourdes Lebosada. For example, itong... May mga affidavits naka-attach sa application nila for... VAT zero rating.

04:28:02.360 --> 04:28:05.620
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Isa na po dito yung... Okay.

04:28:08.740 --> 04:28:19.130
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Puntahan natin tong Annex A dun sa VAT zero rating certificate dated 2024. Affidavit po ni Dr. Lourdes Lebosada.

04:28:25.180 --> 04:28:27.940
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Pakibasa po yung ano, yung first number.

04:28:28.990 --> 04:28:30.390
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito po yung Annex A.

04:28:30.850 --> 04:28:33.950
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Annex A dun sa VAT certificate for the year 2024.

04:28:34.390 --> 04:28:52.810
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: That I have been authorized by the company's board of directors to transact business with BOI relative to our application for BOI certification for VAT zero rating including submission of documents forming part of the firm's application.

04:28:53.720 --> 04:29:05.580
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so this is a sworn statement. Pero mukhang maliho yung statement niya na authorized siya by the board kasi by this time wala na pong quorum dahil tatatlo lang yung directors. So how could they authorize her? Tama po ba?

04:29:06.100 --> 04:29:09.520
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po alam. Basta ito po yung pinagbasihan namin itong sworn.

04:29:09.640 --> 04:29:13.140
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: So nag-rely lang po kayo kung ano man yung sinabi niya? Whether totoo o hindi.

04:29:13.420 --> 04:29:15.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sworn and notarized po.

04:29:15.360 --> 04:29:17.060
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, that's all your honor. Thank you.

04:29:19.300 --> 04:29:22.170
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Redirect, Attorney Justin. If any?

04:29:22.310 --> 04:29:36.550
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yes, Your Honor. Kanina po, Sir Perry, tinanong kayo about yung virtual site inspection noong 2021.

04:29:38.110 --> 04:29:54.510
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Basically, tinanong niya Atty. Erwin at kinumpirman niyo naman na walang tao doon. Could you please explain why the site inspection conducted in 2021 over Cale88 Foods Corporation? Was done virtually, sir.

04:29:56.350 --> 04:30:03.520
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pandemic po kasi nun eh. So may mga quarantine health restrictions. Yun po, pandemic po.

04:30:03.700 --> 04:30:13.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: And just I'll be direct to the point, yung virtual site inspection, how was this applied to all BOI applicants? Was this only for Cale88 Foods Corporation?

04:30:14.460 --> 04:30:21.300
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po. Sa lahat po, talagang wala po kaming choice but to go for virtual inspection.

04:30:21.760 --> 04:30:25.000
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At ulitin ko po, bakit po walang choice yung Board of Investments?

04:30:25.540 --> 04:30:26.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pandemic po eh.

04:30:29.760 --> 04:30:34.100
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: 2026, may site inspection ulit. Tama po ba?

04:30:34.240 --> 04:30:34.580
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo.

04:30:34.760 --> 04:30:39.700
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At paano po sinigawa yung site inspection noong 2026?

04:30:40.600 --> 04:30:43.760
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Physical po pumunta yung mga tao po natin.

04:30:43.940 --> 04:30:51.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: At kanina sinabi niyo po from Manila office. Bakit po physical yung pagpunta? Kumpara noong sa una na virtual lang.

04:30:52.820 --> 04:30:55.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pwede na po kasing pumunta physically.

04:30:57.000 --> 04:31:26.330
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now... Tinanong din ni Atty. Erwin kanina na paano nyo daw malalaman kung nag-ooperate talaga yung kumpanya kung hindi nyo naman talagang physically pinupuntahan ng Board of Investments. Now, para lang po malaman ng prosecution, pati ng publiko, paano ba nga kinukumpirma ng ating Board of Investments, isang malaking institution ng ating gobyerno na talagang nag-ooperate yung mga export enterprise nila?

04:31:27.410 --> 04:31:54.540
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tinitignan po natin kung meron silang revenue na from exports po. So kagaya po halimbawa yung sinabi ko po kanina na doon po sa report nila sa S1, meron pong nakalagay na export revenue. Tapos po may revenue din po sila doon sa kanilang annual financial statement. Tapos po for certain years, noong 2024,

04:31:56.570 --> 04:32:13.830
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Saka nung 2025, nag-apply po sila ng VAT zero rating where for those two years, meron po silang nai-attach na certification ng mga bangko po dun sa inward remittances po nila.

04:32:14.460 --> 04:32:42.750
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Thank you, Sir Perry. Puntahan na naman natin yung mga tanong at mga concerns ng prosecution at pati na po siguro ng ibang tao. Yung mga number of employees ng Cale88 Foods Corporation. Now, I recall, dun sa direct examination natin, may site inspection nung 2026. Ano nga yung discussion with respect to the employees, if you recall, in that site inspection?

04:32:44.840 --> 04:32:51.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Balikan ko lang po. Yung pong naalala ko dito...

04:32:51.420 --> 04:32:55.980
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: That question is vague. Actually, I don't understand what the... What

04:32:55.980 --> 04:32:58.980
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: was stated in the report, Your Honor? I don't know how that's vague.

04:32:59.120 --> 04:33:06.920
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: It was what was stated in the report only. Atty. Erwin, you asked for that same table. I believe the one that reflected 51?

04:33:08.420 --> 04:33:19.040
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: I'm referring to the report on site inspection dated May 18, 2026, Your Honor. There is a finding with respect to the employees. Yes.

04:33:19.060 --> 04:33:24.420
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I'm asking the witness. Based on the finding during the ocular, Dr. Perry.

04:33:24.440 --> 04:34:09.820
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes, that is correct. Ang sinabi po dito ay based on 2025, during the inspection, the firm's compliance with its terms and conditions has been discussed, particularly its direct labor commitment. For 2025, year 3, the firm had to maintain, so ito po yung commitment nila, direct labor of 39. Based on the 2025 BOI Form S1, the firm had an actual labor of 50, while in 2024, they reported 2,001. So sa record soon namin, may 50 siya, but nagtataka lang ho kami bakit bumaba from 201 to 50.

04:34:10.350 --> 04:34:31.030
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Yung tanong ko po kasi sinabi niyo po na may mga tauhan talaga. In fact, I noticed earlier these were high-ranking officials from the Board of Investments who physically went and conducted the ocular inspection. Mayroon po bang finding dun sa ocular inspection na sinabi tatlo lang yung empleyado ng Cale88 Foods Corporation? Kung mayroon man.

04:34:31.310 --> 04:34:31.950
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

04:34:32.650 --> 04:34:59.860
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Now, diniscuss din ni Atty. Erwin kanina. Yung sa Board of Investment Form S1, naalala niyo po. Specifically, sinabi niya, wala daw listahan ng empleyado. May requirement na baga na ganyan na dapat ilista lahat ng mga empleyado ng isang export enterprise or any enterprise registered under the Board of Investment under this BOI S1 form? Mayroong requirement?

04:35:00.340 --> 04:35:00.780
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

04:35:00.960 --> 04:35:25.780
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: Okay. Now, last question. Last question po. Sir, para malaman niyo na nandyan talaga yung export enterprise at nandyan talaga yung produkto, kailangan ba tikman ng Board of Investments ang produkto mismo ng lahat ng enterprise?

04:35:26.220 --> 04:35:26.580
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po.

04:35:26.800 --> 04:35:27.840
Atty. Justin Nicol B. Gular: No further questions.

04:35:28.500 --> 04:35:29.980
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Recross, Atty. Erwin.

04:35:30.220 --> 04:35:30.960
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: None, Your Honor.

04:35:32.180 --> 04:35:37.880
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Interjection from Senator Judges. Chair recognizes Senator Judge Villanueva. You have two minutes, sir. You may proceed when you're ready.

04:35:42.250 --> 04:35:55.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Sen. Villanueva will be followed by Sen. Marcos, thereafter Sen. Hontiveros, thereafter Sen. Sotto, Sen. Erwin Tulfo, and Sen. Bam Aquino. And the Senate President.

04:35:55.220 --> 04:36:29.230
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yes, Mr. Presiding Officer, thank you, Mr. Senate President. Mr. Witness, gusto ko lang pong maintindihan ng gusto, doon sa binabanggit po na GIS, walang nakalagay na empleyado, pero doon sa in-inspect po at Sinumitin na dokumento sa inyo May 115 at nung huli sa site inspection ng May 20, May 2026 ay merong 50. Anong dahilan? Bakit magkaiba po?

04:36:30.530 --> 04:36:58.410
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang masasagot ko lang po yung dun sa form namin. Yung pong binabanggit na 50 doon po sa site inspection ay base rin po yun dun sa Form S1 na sinubmit din po nung kumpanya. Notarized. Yun po yung basehan dun sa 50. Hindi po nagbilang yung mga tao namin kung meron talagang 50 na physically na nandun po ng mga tao. Ang basehan po yung kanilang notarized na submission.

04:37:00.390 --> 04:37:18.290
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tapos po, binabangga din po natin yung direct labor na yun dun sa annual financial statement din po na sinasubmit nung kumpanya. Tinitignan ko may mga notes to the financial statement din puro na nakalagay yung direct labor po nila.

04:37:18.850 --> 04:37:30.310
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Tinitignan ko po, January 1, ah, 2021, nagkaroon ng virtual inspection. And then ang next ay May 2026 na.

04:37:30.530 --> 04:37:31.130
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

04:37:31.230 --> 04:37:32.650
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Limang taon po yung difference.

04:37:33.110 --> 04:37:33.530
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tama po.

04:37:33.970 --> 04:37:35.850
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Bakit to ganung kalahag katagal?

04:37:36.090 --> 04:38:10.380
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Normally naman po hindi naman po talaga kailangan inspectin dahil meron po kaming nagre-rely po tayo sa mga dokumento na sinasubmit nila. Except dito lang din po nung humingi, ang trigger po nung humingi sila ng Certificate of Good Standing in relation to their BOC registration. Kaya po nung humingi sila nun, nung tinignan po, oh bumaba yung kanyang Labor from 200 to 50. Puntahan natin. Tatignan natin kung ano yung nangyayari sa kanya.

04:38:10.620 --> 04:38:32.340
Sen. Joel Villanueva: When you inspect, hindi ba tine-check nyo rin kung bakit nung time na binigyan nyo sila ng incentives, part po ng kanilang plano ay mag-employ and siguro hindi na nakalagay doon kung endo or contractual yung magiging part of the employment or seasonal workers. Would that be correct to say?

04:38:37.020 --> 04:38:46.050
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang tinitignan po yung actual operation tapos kung may mga tao po, hindi ko alam kung na -check pa.

04:38:46.050 --> 04:39:31.040
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Just for you to understand where I'm coming from, siyempre yung incentives bibigay mo pero wala ka ng pakialam whether they are submitting to our labor laws. Contractual ba sila? Because I'm just confused, no? A bit confused because zero rank and file yung nakalagay sa GIS. And yet, you have this amount of sales, revenues. I can't believe na lahat ay contractual. Sino mag-handle ng accounting? Treasury, HR, production heads are also outsourced. I don't think yung key positions cannot be... can be outsourced.

04:39:31.800 --> 04:39:46.450
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron naman po silang nakareflect din ng mga administrative staff po. Pero kasi ang commitment po nila sa amin ay yung direct labor. So kaya po yun yung tinitignan natin.

04:39:46.490 --> 04:39:49.770
Sen. Joel Villanueva: But the direct labor definition doesn't mean you're regular.

04:39:50.010 --> 04:40:13.630
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tama po. At saka po, again po, maikita po namin yung kanilang Yung SSS, ulitin ko lang po, pag nag-apply po sila ng income tax holiday, pero ito hindi nag-a-apply talaga ng, kumbaga po, wala siyang inavail na incentive niya except for the VAT zero rating application for two years.

04:40:15.260 --> 04:40:33.750
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Sir, last na lang po, I'll go to the second round. Bago o pagkatapos bigyan ng BOI registration ang Cale88. Nagkaroon po ba kayo ng actual inspection, yung before? O ito lang, itong virtual inspection lang po?

04:40:36.000 --> 04:40:37.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ito lang pong virtual inspection.

04:40:38.560 --> 04:40:48.600
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So again, dun sa 2021 to 2026, wala pong nangyaring inspection, walang mabe-verify na operation yung kumpanya,

04:40:49.960 --> 04:40:50.400
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

04:40:50.480 --> 04:40:53.100
Sen. Joel Villanueva: walang nakitang packaging facilities, etc.

04:40:54.090 --> 04:40:55.610
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po. Yun lang pong ano.

04:40:57.290 --> 04:41:22.610
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Noon pong nag-apply sila ng VAT zero rating noong 2024. Part po kasi na ng documentary requirement po namin yung pag-submit ng, at that time po, ng barangay certificate. Barangay certificate po na may nag-ooperate po doon sa lugar na yun noong na ganong kumpanya. Yun lang po yung meron kami.

04:41:22.810 --> 04:42:02.190
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Are you aware, Dr. Rodolfo, yung China National Township Enterprise na isa sa mga kumpanyang nagpapadala ng pera dito sa Kalye 88 ay wholly owned subsidiary ng China National Agricultural Development Group na isang Chinese state... Owned Enterprise. Mayroon po bang records o disclosures din sa ang BOI na nagpapakita kung ang naturang Chinese company ay isa sa mga investors, buyers, partners ng KL88?

04:42:02.630 --> 04:42:12.110
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pwede ko pong tignan yan doon po sa VAT zero rating application po nung kumpanya. Check ko lang po ngayon.

04:42:13.840 --> 04:42:15.000
Sen. Joel Villanueva: It might take some time.

04:42:15.060 --> 04:42:16.220
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Mabilis na po. Oh,

04:42:16.240 --> 04:42:17.460
Sen. Joel Villanueva: sure, sure, sure. Kasi po.

04:42:18.180 --> 04:42:20.040
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness may answer but kindly wind up.

04:42:20.240 --> 04:42:21.300
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yeah, I'm winding up.

04:42:22.600 --> 04:42:24.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ano pong kumpanya? Tsaka anong taon po?

04:42:25.260 --> 04:42:28.240
Sen. Joel Villanueva: China National Township Enterprise.

04:42:29.120 --> 04:42:36.020
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Anong taon po kaya siya nagpadala? 2023, 2024, o 2025?

04:42:36.320 --> 04:42:37.680
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yes, around that time po.

04:42:37.920 --> 04:42:55.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi po, 2024 po, butas kami. Wala po siyang application for VAT zero rating. Kaya po wala kaming, ang pinagbabasayan lang po namin ng export sales niya ay yun pong dineclare niya dun sa S1.

04:42:55.770 --> 04:43:15.140
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Siguro, attorney, ang ano ko na lang po is that kung meron po, kung may state-owned enterprise na Nakikipag-transaksyon sa isang Philippine Corporation. Meron po bang additional disclosures o documentation na hinihingi ang BOI depending on the nature of the transaction?

04:43:15.940 --> 04:43:34.100
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Base po sa documentary requirements namin dito sa kumpanyang ito at saka sa similarly situated, wala po kaming, hindi po namin malalaman kung state-owned o hindi state-owned. Kailangan pong mag-extra. Google ho siguro or tatanong ho namin sa aming post.

04:43:34.180 --> 04:43:48.470
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So there would be no record whatsoever from DTI or BOI ng anumang official business engagement. If that's the case. With a state-owned enterprise. Between the Cale88 and the representatives of this Chinese firm.

04:43:48.550 --> 04:44:19.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung ano lang po, kung nasama po siya doon sa, pag nag-a-apply po kasi ng VAT zero rating, sinasama po doon yung Bank Certificate ng mga remittances. Doon po sa Certificate ng remittances, may mga bangko po na nagsasabi kung kanino galing exactly yung remittance kung napumasok, sino yung nagpasok, tsaka dito po sa accounts na to. Doon po, mati-check po namin kung naka-declare po doon.

04:44:19.440 --> 04:44:20.780
Sen. Joel Villanueva: But in this case, wala po?

04:44:21.780 --> 04:44:23.880
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kailangan ko pong i-check kung nandito po siya.

04:44:23.920 --> 04:44:50.460
Sen. Joel Villanueva: And last na po ito, Mr. Presiding Officer, yung Cale88, receive. Approximately 193.95 million in international remittances from China during the period examined in the forensic report na diniscuss po dito. And one of the identified remitters was China National Township Enterprise with remittances of approximately 19.28 million pesos.

04:44:50.480 --> 04:44:52.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Magkano po ulit yun? 193 million?

04:44:52.760 --> 04:44:53.820
Sen. Joel Villanueva: 193 million.

04:44:54.120 --> 04:45:00.610
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi po, ang total sales po, Okay lang po ba na sumagot ako? Yun

04:45:00.610 --> 04:45:03.610
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: po kasing total sales po, base po sa GI,

04:45:03.630 --> 04:45:28.810
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: sa S1 na submissions po ng kumpanya. Kung tototalin ko po yung tatlong taon na 2023, 2024, 2025, aabot po ng 208 million pesos. Thereabouts, 208,748,899. Kung ang sinasabi niyo po, Honorable... Judge ay 190 million.

04:45:29.470 --> 04:45:30.390
Sen. Joel Villanueva: 193. Yes.

04:45:30.870 --> 04:45:31.470
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 193.

04:45:31.510 --> 04:45:35.530
Sen. Joel Villanueva: It's actually in the forensic report. It's not actually. Did not come from me.

04:45:35.630 --> 04:46:00.390
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Basta kung ganun po. Kung sakaling totoo man lang po yun ay ibig sabihin ho halos siya lang po yung kliyente dahil ang sales po nitong ng ating Kali 88 ay 208 or 209 million pesos. I-round off ko na. Over the... 3 years as declared sa amin ng Kompanya sa S-1 Reports na notarized.

04:46:00.580 --> 04:46:04.180
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Opo. Sila yun. Salamat po. Salamat sa witness. Thank you.

04:46:04.260 --> 04:46:08.260
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator Judge Marcos, you may proceed, ma’am. You have two minutes.

04:46:08.840 --> 04:46:40.870
Sen. Imee Marcos: Yes, maraming salamat sa ating presiding judge. At pagod na si Usec. Perry. Akala ko Pax Silica ang pag-uusapan natin eh. Biglang na-impeachment testigo ka pala. In any case, before approving an application for registration, sinabi po ninyo at binasa yung mahabang listahan na yung BOI ini-evaluate yung applicant's proposed investment. Ika nga yung business plan, business operations, production capacity, financial projections. Tama po ba bago...

04:46:41.830 --> 04:46:43.670
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes, Honorable Judge.

04:46:45.010 --> 04:47:09.310
Sen. Imee Marcos: So, klaro sa inyo kaagad na yung business plan, posible. Otherwise, hindi naman ninyo papayagan at ia-approve. And does the BOI require the registered enterprises to report the commencement of actual commercial operations? Kasi nabanggit ninyo kanina, yung start of commercial operations, sinabmit din.

04:47:09.850 --> 04:47:15.310
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo, yun po yung start of commercial operation, yun po yung actual start, actual commercial operation.

04:47:15.410 --> 04:47:16.090
Sen. Imee Marcos: And when was that?

04:47:16.610 --> 04:47:21.490
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa record po natin, January 1, 2023.

04:47:22.090 --> 04:47:26.730
Sen. Imee Marcos: 2023, kaya yun ang unang pasok sa mga papeles, ano?

04:47:26.910 --> 04:47:27.190
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo.

04:47:27.330 --> 04:48:03.550
Sen. Imee Marcos: Tapos, did Cale88 submit this report, yung January 2023? So... It commenced according to BOI records yung 2023, start of the year talaga. Tapos, based on your records din sa BOI, ilan ba talaga yung employees ng Cale88? Kanina pa natin pinag-uusapan yung tatlo sa GIS, pero sinasabi ninyo more than 100, 110 pa yung nabanggit. So, it's not true na dalawa o tatlo lang empleyado? Ano ba talagang pagkaintindi natin? Para i-clarify lang po.

04:48:04.030 --> 04:48:18.350
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Dito po sa submission niya po sa BOI Form S1. Nung 2023 po, 115. Nung 2024, 201. Tapos nung 2025 po ay 50.

04:48:18.890 --> 04:48:32.230
Sen. Imee Marcos: 50. Nag-wind down na. Doon na yung mga problema sa saging sa buong Davao region. Kaya't nag-wind down na. So hindi totoo yung 2 or 3 na empleyado. Claro yun sa BOI.

04:48:32.370 --> 04:48:39.630
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa dokumento po namin, iba ho. Ito po yung mga figures na sinaito.

04:48:39.630 --> 04:48:57.570
Sen. Imee Marcos: That's right. Okay, so based din sa records ninyo, is there any indication that Cale88 Registered Manufacturing and Export Project was fictitious or that the company inflated its commercial operations, its exports? Meron ba kayong basihan na peke to?

04:48:58.690 --> 04:48:59.550
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

04:48:59.870 --> 04:49:13.130
Sen. Imee Marcos: Wala. Wala talagang hint. At therefore, masasabi natin, at least in terms of the BOI at yung dokumentong hawak ninyo, it is not an implausible business model. Tama po ba?

04:49:13.330 --> 04:49:27.090
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko po masagot yung implausible business model, pero ang masasagot ko lang po, may kumpanya po na nagre-report sa amin ng ganitong mga figures. Yun po. O notarized.

04:49:27.730 --> 04:49:39.870
Sen. Imee Marcos: So, hindi siya fictitious at wala namang basehan na sabihin na walang ganong kumpanya. Sa pagkaalam ng BOI, kumpleto naman ang papel at existing naman.

04:49:40.130 --> 04:49:53.850
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sa papel na hawak namin at saka po dun sa pagpunta, yung 2020, early, mga middle part of 2026, meron naman pong nakita.

04:49:53.890 --> 04:49:59.950
Sen. Imee Marcos: Nung nakapunta na kayo na... Patunayan naman ninyo na talagang nag-ooperate siya bilang kumpanya.

04:50:00.270 --> 04:50:00.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

04:50:01.330 --> 04:50:04.410
Sen. Imee Marcos: Maraming salamat yun lang po. Thank you very much, Presiding Judge.

04:50:04.410 --> 04:50:08.750
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Marcos. Senator Judge Risa is recognized. You may proceed, ma'am. You have two minutes.

04:50:15.160 --> 04:50:16.660
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

04:50:18.830 --> 04:50:20.530
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Ganda hapon po, Yusek Rodolfo.

04:50:20.530 --> 04:50:21.850
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Good afternoon po, Senator Judge.

04:50:23.860 --> 04:50:37.770
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kapag po ba rehistradong isang kumpanya gaya ng Cale88 at nagsasubmit ng annual reports, Sigurado na ba yung BOI na above board lahat ng transaction ng ganung kumpanya?

04:50:38.070 --> 04:50:54.330
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang assumption po namin, basta po tama yung pagkakasubmit, notarized, tapos na ibabangga namin sa mga ibang submission din po niya, kagaya ng audited financial statement, tapos nagtutugma naman po ay opo.

04:50:55.410 --> 04:51:06.190
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So kung baga dun lang sa loob ng apat na kanto ng mga dokumento, basta't consistent sa isa't isa, pwede niyong i-presume na above board yung mga operasyon?

04:51:06.810 --> 04:51:16.210
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo. Tsaka po kung every now and then, kung halimbawa nga po kamukha nung may nag-request ng Certificate of Good Standing tapos binisita, ganun po.

04:51:16.510 --> 04:51:22.270
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yun yung iba kapag binisita. So kapag may actual na inspection on the ground.

04:51:22.370 --> 04:51:23.410
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo. Pag may nag-trigger.

04:51:24.130 --> 04:51:26.450
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kapag may nag-trigger. Okay po.

04:51:31.510 --> 04:51:55.770
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Nakumpirman niyo po ba kung yung export sales at yung inward remittances sa mga reports ng Cale88 sa BOI ay eksaktong tumutugma dun sa lampas 770 million pesos na finlag na inflows ng AMLC?

04:51:57.200 --> 04:52:23.300
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po akong alam dun sa AMLC kung ano man po yung figures niya. Ang alam ko po yung figures po na reported sa atin. At yung ito po ay galing sa kumpanya. So submitted, as I said po, notarized. And in two years ay backed up po ng bank certification ng inward remittances.

04:52:26.540 --> 04:53:05.010
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: May mga hindi po sakto. Halimbawa po nung 2023, meron po siyang sinayit na export figures. Pag binangga po namin sa bank certification, mas mababa po ng konti. Pero pag tinitignan naman po kasi namin, papasok pa rin ba siya dun sa 70% na export requirement natin? Kasi po yun po yung talagang binabantayan namin sa... Bank VAT zero rating application. 2024 po wala kaming basihan kundi po yung sinubmit niya. Tapos po 2025 meron po.

04:53:06.550 --> 04:53:08.030
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Anong meron po sa 2025?

04:53:08.170 --> 04:53:13.790
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Meron pong bank certification na na-receive po kami dahil nag-apply po siya ng VAT zero rating.

04:53:14.290 --> 04:53:17.320
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So at the very, yes. Sige po.

04:53:18.180 --> 04:53:20.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: New owners na po ito sa 2020.

04:53:23.470 --> 04:53:40.010
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 2026, nung nag-apply po siya, covering the 2025 po yung mga nire-review namin. New owners na po yun sa 2026. Doon po kay Dr. Lebozada, doon lang po siya sa 2024 application, covering yung 2023.

04:53:40.930 --> 04:54:04.970
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kahit pag-usapan lang natin yung 2023 hanggang 2025, at least sa simula, meron kayong nakitang kaunting discrepancies sa pagitan ng submissions ng Cale88 sa inyo at yung bank certificates. Pero wala pa po kayong pagbangga ng mga findings sa AMLC or mga flag transactions ng AMLC dun sa sinumite ng Cale88.

04:54:04.970 --> 04:54:07.150
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi namin tinitignan kasi yun.

04:54:07.570 --> 04:54:28.080
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay po. Sa karanasan po ninyo, kung may lehitimong export contract ang isang transaksyon, likely po ba na ma-flag yan as suspicious due to no underlying legal or trade obligations, purpose, or economic justification?

04:54:29.240 --> 04:54:30.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Paulit po.

04:54:30.400 --> 04:54:46.210
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Yes. Likely po ba na ma-flag as suspicious Due to no underlying legal or trade obligations, purpose, or economic justification, kung may lehitimong export contract ang isang transaksyon.

04:54:47.860 --> 04:54:49.260
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sino po magpa-flag?

04:54:49.940 --> 04:54:54.940
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Kung may kahit sino mang ibang agency na mag-flag. In this case, for example, AMLC.

04:54:55.220 --> 04:55:04.460
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ordinarily po, kung legit, yung makikita lang po namin na mga transactions, ordinarily, parang wala po.

04:55:05.850 --> 04:55:07.970
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Sige po, baka balikan ko yun sa round 2.

04:55:08.070 --> 04:55:10.030
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes? Hindi ako sigurado.

04:55:10.090 --> 04:55:24.650
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Hindi kayo sigurado. Kaya babalikan ko po sa round 2. Pero huling tanong, Mr. Presiding Officer, dito sa round 1, tama po ba na registered as micro and small enterprise ang Cale88?

04:55:25.170 --> 04:55:25.990
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tama po.

04:55:26.430 --> 04:55:43.680
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay po. Eh, hanggang ngayon po ba ay... Registrado pa rin ang Cale88 bilang micro and small enterprise at nakakakuha ng mga benepisyon noon? Halimbawa yung hindi pagbayad ng tax or walang VAT?

04:55:44.040 --> 04:55:58.760
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung relevance po kasi nung kanyang pagiging micro and small enterprise ay with respect po dun sa napabilis po yung kanyang application process dahil pumasok po siya dun sa

04:56:01.420 --> 04:56:21.760
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Delegated na po yung pag-approve sa kanya dun po sa Davao BEO po namin. So mas mabilis po tsaka yung 3 days na under our citizens charter dapat po ma-approve from the time na mag-provide ng complete documentary requirements.

04:56:23.370 --> 04:56:31.290
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Itutuloy ko sa round 2, lampas dun sa pag-apply ng Cale88 bilang small and micro enterprise. Salamat po. Salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer.

04:56:31.630 --> 04:56:37.830
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Sotto. The former Senate President is recognized. Thereafter, Senator Judge Erwin.

04:56:44.830 --> 04:57:29.430
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Thank you, kind sir. I was not intending to ask any questions anymore. Pretty much black and white originally mga narinig ko. So okay na sana. But you see here in the Senate, aside from the 20 senators, maraming mga legal stuff eh. Easily, Tigalawa. Eh mayroon pang open source na mga media at kung saan saan. So there are many questions that arise. So help me out. I am somehow suffering from a conundrum. Doon sa mga nabagit mo kanina before lunch and ngayong after lunch.

04:57:31.720 --> 04:57:40.240
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Linawin ko muna. Ito yung mga binibigay niyong fiscal incentives to everyone. Income tax holiday.

04:57:40.600 --> 04:57:44.360
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So registered enterprises po, Your Honor.

04:57:46.380 --> 04:57:47.740
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Lower income tax.

04:57:49.240 --> 04:57:50.580
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, in the form of...

04:57:50.580 --> 04:57:56.320
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: After tax holiday. After that... VAT zero rating

04:57:56.320 --> 04:58:00.940
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: for export -oriented enterprises.

04:58:01.640 --> 04:58:04.100
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: VAT exemption on imports.

04:58:05.860 --> 04:58:09.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Duty-free exemption on the importations.

04:58:09.980 --> 04:58:16.160
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Custom duty exemption. Lower local taxes.

04:58:18.480 --> 04:58:45.590
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Depende po sa... Sa locality po, dun sa LGU. At saka po kung nandun po sila sa, kung ang pinili po nila, kung for export po sila, tas pinili po nila ay yung special corporate income tax, then yung pong 5% na special corporate income tax ay all in na po yun, tapos ibibigay na lang po yung share ng local government po dun.

04:58:46.140 --> 04:59:12.630
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Okay. Now, this is my confusion. Before lunch, sabi niyo, Cale88 is continuously, just records natin, benefiting from tax incentives. It's a direct quote nung binanggit niyo kanina during your direct examination eh. So ano-ano itong tax incentives na binibigay sa Kali 88?

04:59:13.030 --> 04:59:40.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ah, Honorable Senate, Honorable Judge, hindi ko maalala kung binanggit ko po yun. Pero po, hindi, ang naalala ko pong sinabi ko, hindi siya nag-avail ng tax incentive. Hindi po siya nag-avail ng income tax holiday. Hindi po siya nag-avail ng duty-free importation. Ang inavail lang po niya ay yung pong VAT zero rating. Yun lang po. And for two years.

04:59:40.760 --> 04:59:56.730
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Eh kasi marami kami dito, ganun na intindi namin sa sinabi mo kanina, pero yan ang sinabi mo after lunch. Well, we can check on the records of the journal. So, you're saying na, okay, you're saying that Cale88, wala kayong binigay tax incentives.

04:59:57.150 --> 04:59:58.450
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po siya nag-avail.

04:59:58.750 --> 05:00:00.780
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Hindi siya nag-avail. So wala kayong binigay.

05:00:00.900 --> 05:00:03.560
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Can I explain po, Honorable Judge?

05:00:03.880 --> 05:00:04.320
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Yeah, go ahead.

05:00:04.580 --> 05:00:40.080
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi po, dun sa first year niya po, lugi po siya. So meaningless po sa kanya yung income tax holiday. Sa second year po niya, nung 2024, lugi pa rin po siya. So hindi pa rin po siya nag-avail ng income tax holiday dahil wala din naman po siya talagang kailangan bayaran. Nung 2025 po, meron po siyang income na. Pero hindi po siya nag-avail ng income tax holiday po. So wala po kaming naibigay na income tax holiday sa Cali.

05:00:40.080 --> 05:00:57.750
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: So as of now, from 2021 hanggang 2025, iba yung 2026, iba na may ari, iba na binenta eh. Pinag-uusapan dito yung 2021-2025. Sinasabi nyo, wala. Hindi sila nag-avail ng kahit anong tax incentives from BOI.

05:00:58.050 --> 05:01:05.850
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 2023 po siya nag-start ng commercial operation, hindi po siya nag-avail. 2024 hindi po. 2025 hindi rin po.

05:01:06.070 --> 05:01:06.590
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: So wala?

05:01:06.870 --> 05:01:08.410
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala pong income tax holiday.

05:01:09.040 --> 05:01:12.820
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Eh bakit ganun ang intindi namin kanina sa sinabi nyo na mayroong tax incentives?

05:01:13.220 --> 05:01:17.160
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pasensya na po, pero ito po yung ganito po. Talagang hindi po siya nag-avail.

05:01:17.520 --> 05:01:28.150
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Alright. Ngayon, just to... Clarify issues on income tax. Yung mga corporate income tax, pagka yung mga ganito, hindi nagbabayad ano?

05:01:28.410 --> 05:01:30.430
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Pag income tax holiday po, wala.

05:01:31.060 --> 05:01:33.350
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Yung tax holiday. Yung mga owners?

05:01:34.250 --> 05:01:38.930
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: As individuals po, meron po silang personal income tax.

05:01:40.010 --> 05:01:46.950
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Merong mga pagkakaiba yung GIS na sinubmit sa inyo at sinubmit sa SEC. Are you aware of that?

05:01:47.540 --> 05:02:02.340
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po. Yung pong dinasubmit sa amin kung yung tungkol o halimbawa dun sa 2024 and 2025 sa change in ownership, kung ano po yung sinubmit nila sa SEC, yun din po dapat yung isubmit nila sa amin.

05:02:02.360 --> 05:02:06.600
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Pero sa records, iba eh. Isinubmit sa inyo saka sinubmit sa SEC.

05:02:08.200 --> 05:02:35.130
Sen. Vicente C. Sotto III: Anyway, ayun yung point kanina ng Senator Villanueva also. But nevertheless, sige, I just suggest that siguro BOI dapat you should be more diligent and more research on giving out incentives to everybody. Tsaka yung binabanggit niyo yung notarized, medyo nangingiti po ako eh. Kasi sinubmit, eh notarized naman. Dito po may mga nagsasabit ng notarized eh. Napalpak. Remember?

05:02:38.960 --> 05:02:46.320
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator Judge Erwin Tulfo is recognized. You have two minutes, sir, when you're ready. Next would be the Senate President. Thereafter, Senator Judge Bam Aquino.

05:02:47.770 --> 05:03:04.820
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Thank you very much, Mr. Presiding Officer. Ginoong testigo, sir, hindi po ba ninyo chine-check ang mga incorporators or board of directors na mga kumpanya na magkaparehistro sa inyo? Ito po ang Cale88 po.

05:03:05.600 --> 05:03:26.360
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alam niyo naman siguro itong nasa Article 7, Section 13 ng ating Constitution na ang Vice Presidente bawal po ma-affiliate sa mga negosyo. I mean, well, through her husband, di po ba? Community property po yun yung negosyo. Hindi ninyo chinecheck?

05:03:26.600 --> 05:03:40.240
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Normally po, hindi na po eh. Ang mas concerned po kami limbawa kung mayroong restriction dun sa sector. Kagaya po alimbawa bawal ang foreigner or dapat to merong limitation lang doon sa foreign equity ownership.

05:03:41.100 --> 05:03:58.880
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alright. Isa pa akong katanungan. Nabanggit nyo kanina virtual lang pag inspect ninyo ng mga kumpanya. Hindi o talaga ninyo physically chinecheck kapag may nagparehistro sa inyo? I mean, wala? I mean, kung saan lang, gino-google lang ninyo?

05:03:59.020 --> 05:04:13.140
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Simula po ng pandemic, pero kung... May mga na-inspect din naman po kami. Ngayon na po. Nung pandemic po talagang walang physical inspection. Pero ngayon na po may mga na-inspect naman po kami yung physical.

05:04:13.480 --> 05:04:59.960
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: No wonder. Kaya hindi po ako nagtataka. Napakadami mga kumpanya na mga scammer. Napakadami mga Pilipino ang naluloko sa online. na nagbabayad ng pera. Pag hinabol na nila, pupuntahan lang kumpanya. E isang lupa na mga puno ng saging lang ang laman, o damuhan, o lumang bahay, pero wala talaga doon yung kumpanya. Ito yung, I think that the problem there is, nagpaparehistro sila para magamit lang legit. May mga bibigyan nyo sila ng mga permit, pero illegitimate. I mean, ibig ka nga eh, fly by night. Ginagamit lang po kayo para manloko ng tao, para legitimate. Hindi niyo ba ako alam yan na marami pong na-scam ngayon?

05:05:01.820 --> 05:05:26.480
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Honorable Judge, very specific lang po yung mga sectors na nire-register po namin. Ito po yung mga strategic sectors. So kung halimbawa po hindi po namin kayang physically puntahan, meron naman po kaming ibang mga paraan kagaya po halimbawa virtual, titignan po namin. Pero po yung mga binabanggit po ng halimbawa ng mga nag-scam, hindi naman po nare-register din po?

05:05:26.660 --> 05:06:13.510
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Siyempre sir, hindi naman nila sasabihin mga scammer sila, di ba ba? Magpaparehistro, for example ako, magre-rehistro ako ng kumpanya, eh talagang target ko naman local na ng tao, pupunta ako sa inyo, sa BOI, i-rehistro ko yung kumpanya ko, tapos maglalagay ako ng isang lugar doon, maglalakad-lakad, ah ito, number 1, 2, 3, ilang-ilang, or whatever street. Tapos ire-rehistro ko na. Eh hindi ko naman kumpanya yun. Kaya marami yung tayo sa office ko, marami yung nagre-reklamo na gano'n. Na naloloko sila pag sisingilin nila o kukuha sila ng refund. Eh wala ho, wala silang madatnan dahil peke-dos, peke yung nirehistro sa inyo na address. Siguro, sir, sa susunod kailangan ninyong tignan. Ano po?

05:06:13.790 --> 05:06:14.250
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Sige po.

05:06:14.370 --> 05:06:54.260
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alright, my last question po, Mr. Presiding Officer, if you would please. Posible po ba ang kumpanya kagaya po ng Cali 88 na 125,000 pesos lang ang paid up capital at may dalawang empleyado na sinasabing la would rack up over 700 million pesos sales in 3 to 4 years. Pero yung kanilang export worth, exported na goods ay worth 250 million lang. Only on the same period din. Posible po ba yun? 125,000 pero ang kanilang sales, 700 million. Parang maganda ho mag-invest dito.

05:06:55.560 --> 05:07:24.270
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Nung tinignan po namin yung kanilang business plan, ang tinignan po namin dun sa kanilang project cost na umaabot ng 12 million, yun ho yung posible. Yun pong kaya po. Based doon sa kanilang mga sinabing i-invest nila, kaya po nila yung capacity that will deliver yung ganitong amount po. Doon po namin siya tinignan.

05:07:24.390 --> 05:07:27.310
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Na 700 million, 125,000. Sorry,

05:07:27.770 --> 05:07:32.470
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 700 million. Wala po kaming kinalaman doon sa 700 million. Na

05:07:32.470 --> 05:07:32.790
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: sales.

05:07:33.250 --> 05:07:36.030
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Na sales. Wala po kaming kinalaman sa 700. Kaya

05:07:36.030 --> 05:07:55.190
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: nga may question is, posibleng ho kaya ito? May mga nakita na ba kayong company na less than 1 million, less than half a million, tapos would rack up, would make sales in 3 to 4 years, eh times 1,000, 10,000 percent po. Ika nga yung kikitain.

05:07:56.180 --> 05:08:00.840
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: I have no capacity to make that judgment, Honorable Senator.

05:08:00.940 --> 05:08:04.080
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alright. Maraming salamat po, Mr. Witness. Thank you, Presiding Officer.

05:08:04.440 --> 05:08:06.940
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator Judge Erwin. The Senate Presidents are recognized.

05:08:07.960 --> 05:08:10.180
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you. Thank you, Mr. President. Hello.

05:08:10.300 --> 05:08:18.460
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer. Ganang hapon, Yusef Perry. Sundan ko lang po yung mga tanong ni Senator Riza kanina.

05:08:20.340 --> 05:08:35.940
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Narinig ko ho sa inyo, tsaka tinitignan ko yung mga sidamit niyo, mga dokumento, na from 2022 to 2025, ng audited sales ng Cali 8.8 is 208 million. Tama po ba?

05:08:37.190 --> 05:08:38.710
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, Honorable Judge.

05:08:39.010 --> 05:08:39.190
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero

05:08:39.190 --> 05:08:53.750
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: nung tinitignan ko rin yung pinakita ng AMLC, I'll flash it, na ang inward remittance is about P776 million. Yung inward remittance niya.

05:08:56.650 --> 05:08:59.550
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: I'll just flash lang namin sa screen.

05:09:08.280 --> 05:09:10.840
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yan, P776 million.

05:09:12.940 --> 05:09:24.040
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Sa inyong karanasan, dahil alam ko expert kayo pagdating sa incentives, matagal na rin kayo sa BOI, anong possible reason dito dahil ang laki ng discrepancy?

05:09:26.330 --> 05:09:36.010
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Anong meron bang undervaluing of sales, hindi nagde-declare ng tama? Base sa inyong analysis, dahil matagal na

05:09:36.010 --> 05:10:00.060
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: kayo sa... DTI, at kabisado nyo yung mga ganito nag-a-apply ng incentives. Anong possible reason ang layo ng numbers? At kahit na tinitignan ko yung balance sheet, may 20 million na advances from shareholders. Kahit na idagdag yung advances, dahil in-flow rin yan, hindi aabot ng 776.

05:10:01.320 --> 05:10:28.030
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: In relation po, honorable judge, dun sa operations po nung kumpanya at saka po dun sa mga sinabit nila sa aming dokumento, wala akong makitang rason para tumaas po sila ng more than dito po sa declared sales revenue po nila na sinabit sa amin. So, yun po.

05:10:28.210 --> 05:10:42.900
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: At tinitignan ko rin yung... Yung documento niya sinabit niyo sa amin, yung kanilang bank certification, yung mga sinertify ng bank ko na pumasok, is about 43 million. Tama po ba?

05:10:44.220 --> 05:10:56.240
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung sa record ko po, yung bank certification po kasi in dollars. So ang nasa record po namin, base po dun sa kanilang

05:10:57.760 --> 05:11:19.340
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: VAT zero rating application, $352,000 noong 2023. Ito po yung related sa sales po nila. Tapos po sa 2025 ay $368,000. Kung ito total ko po, $368,000.

05:11:32.820 --> 05:11:43.540
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So $721,283. dollars po. Yun po. Yung covered ng bank certificate.

05:11:44.040 --> 05:11:44.880
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Magkano yun yung peso?

05:11:46.300 --> 05:11:49.080
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Assume ko na lang po ba na 58 kunyari?

05:11:49.180 --> 05:11:51.600
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: 58 kasi matagal-tagal na rin to.

05:11:51.900 --> 05:11:56.920
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 58? Ano po? 41,834,414.

05:11:56.920 --> 05:11:57.180
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So

05:11:57.180 --> 05:12:09.520
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: malayo pa rin from 41 million ang sinertify ng banko na pumasok versus sinasabi ng AMLC na 700 million ang inflows. Malayo pa rin. Mas malayo.

05:12:12.220 --> 05:12:15.980
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Anong mga possible reasons based on your experience?

05:12:16.480 --> 05:12:32.860
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Doon lang po sa reporting sa mga dokumentong hawak po kasi namin. Hindi po kasi sila nag-file ng VAT zero rating for 2020, for 2025.

05:12:33.260 --> 05:12:59.100
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So kaya po wala po tayong bank certificates covering the 2024 period. Yung 2024 period po kung titignan natin yung kanilang sinasabit na export sales, yung po yung may pinakamataas sila dapat na export sales na umabot po ng 150 million. So wala po kaming kopya ng bank certificates.

05:12:59.100 --> 05:12:59.340
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: At

05:12:59.340 --> 05:13:57.120
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: yun ang next na tanong ko dahil nga Ang isang kumpanya nag-a-apply sa BOI for the incentives, di ba ho? Lalo na yung VAT zero rating para hindi ka magbayad ng VAT. Pag export-oriented enterprise ka. Pero why go all through the trouble tapos hindi ka rin mag-a-apply ng VAT zero rating? Sabi nga kanina ni former Senate President Tito Sotto, pati other incentives like ITH, yung duty, customs duty exemptions. Bakit hindi sila nag-apply base sa iyong analysis and observation? The whole point kaya nga mag-BOI register ka is for the incentives. Kung hindi, di wag ka na mag-BOI register anymore. Pwede ka naman maging normal corporation at mag-export ka. Lalo na in 2024 dahil malaki yung sales nila. 150 million. Sa tingin mo, anong analysis? Bakit ganun?

05:13:57.520 --> 05:13:58.720
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Honorable Senator,

05:14:01.930 --> 05:14:28.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Lalo na po dahil export-oriented siya, alam tayo po dito pagka meron tayong mga panukala kayo po at kami po sa BOI, pinag-uusapan yung mga bagay na importante sa mga exporter. Kung maalala niyo po, VAT zero rating yung isa sa mga talagang pinag-aawayan. It has to be very facilitative.

05:14:31.520 --> 05:14:35.320
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Within that context po, hindi

05:14:37.110 --> 05:14:38.970
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: ko rin po alam kung bakit hindi siya nag-apply.

05:14:39.630 --> 05:15:05.640
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Kasi alam mo naman, alam ni Senate, ni presiding officer to, yung Create More Law na pinasa natin. Isa sa pinakamainit na topic doon, yung VAT. Kaya yan talaga ang hinahabol ng mga investors natin, lalo na export enterprise. Kaya nagtataka ko. Bakit hindi nila inavail? Dahil BOI registered naman sila.

05:15:05.880 --> 05:15:15.260
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kadamihan po ng mga exporter, kung meron po silang ganyang incentive, would avail of it, would maximize it po.

05:15:15.900 --> 05:15:40.820
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Lastly, Mr. Presiding Officer, last question na ito. Nakita ko rin dito sa mga application, these are all self-declaration. Itong... Itong S-1 application ninyo, yung annual report on actual operations, even yung application ng VAT zero rating, based on good faith to.

05:15:41.580 --> 05:15:48.980
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yung, Honorable Judge, yung VAT zero rating po, yes, pero may mga nakakadikit po na bank certificate.

05:15:49.480 --> 05:16:02.900
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Yes, oo, galing sa bank ko. Pero yung S-1 form, yung annual report on actual operations, based on good faith to. Kung anong dineclare ko sa inyo, Yun na ang gagamitin yung basis.

05:16:03.180 --> 05:16:03.480
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes po.

05:16:03.900 --> 05:16:19.260
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Mababangga naman po, again, dun sa annual audited financial statement na galing po sa kanila. At saka po, to the extent na nag-apply sila ng VAT zero rating, dun po sa bank certificate po nung inflows nila ng export sales.

05:16:19.580 --> 05:16:23.200
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ang hindi ko nakikita dito ay yung customs documentation.

05:16:24.720 --> 05:16:26.560
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: For example, bill of lading.

05:16:28.450 --> 05:16:32.110
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Paano natin malalaman kung mayroon talagang export na nangyari?

05:16:32.450 --> 05:16:48.150
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, makukuha po yun sa Bureau of Customs, tapos po nire-report po nila yun for compilation ng data sa PSA, sa Philippine Statistics Authority. Doon po sa kanila makukuha po yun.

05:16:48.150 --> 05:17:02.750
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero sa inyo, sa pagbibigay nyo ng incentives at reportorial ng mga corporation, hindi... Nakita ko hindi kasama dito yung customs documents para malaman kung talagang mayroong lumabas na goods.

05:17:03.250 --> 05:17:04.130
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

05:17:04.350 --> 05:17:04.570
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ang

05:17:04.570 --> 05:17:09.730
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: base nyo lang yung inordinate test ng bangko at yung invoice na galing rin sa kanila.

05:17:10.230 --> 05:17:10.870
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Pero

05:17:10.870 --> 05:17:17.370
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: yung actual customs, let's say, bill of lading or any supporting documents na mayroong lumabas na goods, wala.

05:17:17.510 --> 05:17:17.870
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala

05:17:17.870 --> 05:17:18.090
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: po.

05:17:18.370 --> 05:17:22.690
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Baka yan ang dapat natin tignan, Yusek, dahil of course

05:17:22.690 --> 05:17:38.850
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: alam natin. Nagbibigay tayong incentives to attract exporter but talagang dapat may export na nangyayari. Lalo na ngayon kasi ang konteksto mas malaki nga yung inflows versus the actual sales and the actual bank remittance. Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

05:17:42.160 --> 05:17:44.580
