05:18:10.530 --> 05:18:11.070
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes po.

05:18:11.210 --> 05:18:13.010
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Yes. It is registered with the BOI?

05:18:13.150 --> 05:18:13.650
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes po.

05:18:13.810 --> 05:18:14.830
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: It is properly registered?

05:18:15.310 --> 05:18:15.690
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes po.

05:18:15.790 --> 05:18:18.690
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Correct. Okay. May pictures kayo nung factory?

05:18:19.130 --> 05:18:19.510
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Yes po.

05:18:19.610 --> 05:18:21.210
