05:18:21.910 --> 05:18:22.270
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo.

05:18:22.450 --> 05:18:23.770
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Meron diba? Napakita kanina.

05:18:23.910 --> 05:18:24.050
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Apo.

05:18:24.190 --> 05:18:24.350
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay.

05:18:26.760 --> 05:18:31.900
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Hindi sila nag-avail ng tax-free status? Is that correct to say?

05:18:33.300 --> 05:18:34.760
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Anong klaseng tax po, sir?

05:18:35.280 --> 05:18:39.400
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Apat yan, di ba? VAT, tax holiday, corporate income. You

05:18:39.400 --> 05:18:40.520
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: explain to

05:18:40.520 --> 05:18:40.960
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: us. Yung income

05:18:40.960 --> 05:18:42.140
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: tax holiday, wala po.

05:18:42.360 --> 05:18:42.760
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Sorry,

05:18:42.840 --> 05:18:43.020
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: wala

05:18:43.020 --> 05:18:45.200
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: meaning hindi sila nag-apply or wala sila nakuha?

05:18:45.440 --> 05:19:01.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po sila nag-apply. Doon po sa SEIT, hindi po sila eligible kasi wala pa doon sa period. Doon po sa duty-free importation, wala po silang in-import. Wala po hindi sila nag-apply.

05:19:01.600 --> 05:19:02.500
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Kasi export sila.

05:19:02.660 --> 05:19:03.100
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Export

05:19:03.100 --> 05:19:03.420
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: sila.

05:19:03.420 --> 05:19:03.700
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi ko

05:19:03.700 --> 05:19:06.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: alam kung meron silang in-import na raw

05:19:06.600 --> 05:19:07.060
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: equipment.

05:19:07.820 --> 05:19:08.520
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Or equipment.

05:19:08.900 --> 05:19:13.020
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Tapos po dun sa VAT zero rating, on two years lang po

05:19:13.020 --> 05:19:13.700
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: sila nag-avail.

05:19:14.200 --> 05:19:19.820
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So pagating sa tax, dun lang sila sa VAT zero rating nakakuha ng incentive?

05:19:20.300 --> 05:19:21.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: In effect po, yes.

05:19:21.700 --> 05:19:22.340
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: What year was that?

05:19:22.360 --> 05:19:26.780
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 2020, 2024.

05:19:26.860 --> 05:19:36.560
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kasi po yun yung binanga sa 2023 performance po nila and then 2026 binanga naman po sa 2025 performance.

05:19:36.980 --> 05:19:41.060
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Tama ba na yung VAT zero rating pertains to the purchase of raw materials?

05:19:42.580 --> 05:19:43.500
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, yes.

05:19:43.820 --> 05:19:49.760
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. Tama rin ba na sa inyong dokumento 208 million yung total sales nila?

05:19:50.600 --> 05:19:51.840
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Thereabouts po. Roughly.

05:19:52.060 --> 05:19:52.700
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Kasi

05:19:52.700 --> 05:20:06.930
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: we have the BIR submission. It's also the same number. So tumutugma itong total sales, 208 million. Dito rin sa BIR, 8.1 million yung loss. You also

05:20:06.930 --> 05:20:08.650
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: have those records?

05:20:09.450 --> 05:20:12.110
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 1.8 plus 6 million. Mga ganun po.

05:20:12.310 --> 05:20:13.770
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Well, in 2022,

05:20:15.480 --> 05:20:27.460
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Negative 42,255. In 2023, negative 1.88 million. In 2024, negative 6.1 million. And in 2025, negative 48,000.

05:20:27.700 --> 05:20:33.120
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: 2025 po, 375,000 positive po sila sa net income.

05:20:33.590 --> 05:20:40.970
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Well, sa BIR submission to this court, it was negative 48,000. But in any case, lugi yung kumpanya.

05:20:41.830 --> 05:20:43.830
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Oo, lulugi po siya.

05:20:44.060 --> 05:20:48.400
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Yung BOI status ba? Has any connection kung lugi ka o kumikita ka?

05:20:48.460 --> 05:20:49.000
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi naman po.

05:20:49.120 --> 05:20:57.980
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Hindi naman, no? Hindi siya affected? So, lahat na napag-usapan ko, more or less, this is part of the course of a regular business. Is that your estimation?

05:20:58.360 --> 05:20:58.640
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo.

05:20:58.740 --> 05:21:28.120
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. Ang hindi ko nalang talaga maintindihan, yung AMLA inflow na nabanggit ni Senator Sherwin kanina at nabanggit ni Senator Risa, 700 million yung pumasok. Of which 315 million ay galing sa China. Napag-uusapan yan. Pero 208 million lang yung declared na kinita. Okay. And you cannot hazard a guess kung paano nangyari yan.

05:21:28.120 --> 05:21:30.580
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po expert sa ng AMLC.

05:21:32.520 --> 05:21:42.720
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: So ang alam ko lang po yung operation nila, it should be 208 million pesos yung papasok.

05:21:43.560 --> 05:21:49.240
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So dapat 208 million yung papasok kasi 208 million yung nakadeklara nakita.

05:21:49.360 --> 05:21:51.240
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo. Nabenta po nila.

05:21:51.240 --> 05:22:12.890
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Unless may investor ka galing sa ibang bansa or may... You're an expert here Yuseg Perry. Yung ibang perang papasok sa bank account mo... Kung hindi ito sales, kasi ang sales na deklarado ay 208 million, posibleng ano ito? Maybe hypothetically, posibleng ano po ito? Kasi that's about

05:22:12.890 --> 05:22:15.070
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: 500 million more than your declared sales.

05:22:15.090 --> 05:22:39.370
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang masasabi ko lang po, Honorable Judge, is dun po sa pagkakaalam namin ng operation nila, tsaka sa mga declaration nila sa amin, wala silang ibang source of income, kundi itong operation lang po na ito. Kaya po kung tatanungin niyo ako kung ano dapat yung pumapasok sa kanila, ito lang pong amount na to. As to the other sources, I would be purely guessing kung magsasalita ko.

05:22:39.370 --> 05:22:59.830
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay, since pinag-uusapan dito kung expert ka ba o hindi, but you've been in the DTI for more than a decade already. Huwag muna tong Cali 88, pero pag may nakita kang gantong transaction report na may deklaradong a certain amount, pwede rin pumasok na pera, almost times 3. Posibleng ano yun?

05:23:01.730 --> 05:23:04.030
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po ako nakikitang ganito po eh.

05:23:04.170 --> 05:23:06.130
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Na kaso na ibang kumpanya?

05:23:06.430 --> 05:23:09.770
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Na kapareho ng ganito po. Yung iba po kasi meron silang, for example,

05:23:09.970 --> 05:23:25.910
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: foreign exchange earnings. Yung iba po halimbawa may interest na pumasok, interest income, some other. Pero yun din po kasi dinideclare din po dapat sa amin yun kung meron silang other sources of income. Dito po walang nakadeclare po sa amin other sources.

05:23:25.910 --> 05:23:28.890
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So merong hindi deklarado na pumasok na pera?

05:23:29.700 --> 05:23:30.220
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Pag

05:23:30.220 --> 05:23:32.540
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: ipagsama-sama mo yung mga datos natin.

05:23:33.580 --> 05:23:43.880
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung ibabangga mo po dun sa sinasabi na iba na pumasok sa kanila, may difference po. Pero wala akong alam ko dun. Ito lang yung alam ko.

05:23:44.020 --> 05:23:51.060
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. So ito po, last question, Mr. Presiding Officer. So Yusek Perry, wala ka naman kinalaman talaga sa Kali 88, di ba?

05:23:51.100 --> 05:23:51.200
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po.

05:23:51.200 --> 05:24:02.440
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Hindi ka naman officer doon. Sino ba talaga yung makakapag-explain kung ganito karaming pera yung pumasok, ganito karaming diniklara? Who can really explain this? It's not you.

05:24:02.700 --> 05:24:03.280
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Hindi po ako.

05:24:03.560 --> 05:24:05.440
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: O sino ba? Sino ba yung...

05:24:05.440 --> 05:24:15.420
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Ang tingin ko po yung si President, si Treasurer, yun po nagpa-file sa amin ng mga apidabit na nakapirma po siya si...

05:24:15.420 --> 05:24:17.040
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Can you give a name?

05:24:17.580 --> 05:24:18.720
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Lebo... Si

05:24:18.720 --> 05:24:20.560
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Dr. Lebosado, Lourdes...

05:24:20.560 --> 05:24:21.460
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Opo, siya

05:24:21.460 --> 05:24:21.600
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: po.

05:24:21.760 --> 05:24:23.000
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: She's the owner, actually.

05:24:23.340 --> 05:24:32.740
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Part one owner po siya and I think Treasurer yung... Designation niya and siya po yung nakapirma dun sa mga submissions niya po sa amin nung sila pa po yung may-ari.

05:24:32.800 --> 05:24:33.000
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Sige.

05:24:33.120 --> 05:24:43.520
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Can you name nga, sino yung mga posibleng makakapag-explain nito? Hindi po kayo eh. It's the owners, the general manager, the president, the treasurer, the auditor.

05:24:44.480 --> 05:24:50.940
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Operating officer. Operating officer. Yung kung meron silang export sales manager, mga ganun po.

05:24:51.140 --> 05:24:52.140
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Export sales manager.

05:24:52.260 --> 05:24:54.990
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kung meron po. Part ng kumpanya. Opo.

05:24:55.090 --> 05:25:17.630
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay. And siguro po, Mr. Presiding Officer, para malaman talaga natin kung ano ba talaga yung totoo dito po sa perang ito, maganda kung ma-present rin yung mga taong yan para lang ma-explain kung ano. Because I think we will continue asking Yusek Rodolfo na hindi naman talaga niya alam yung mga sagot po dito. Thank you po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

05:25:18.310 --> 05:25:18.790
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank

05:25:18.790 --> 05:25:23.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: you. Senator Judge Raffi is recognized. You have two minutes, sir. You may proceed when you're ready.

