Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Mr. Witness, Paano po nalalaman kung talagang merong ine-export ang Kale 88 na produkto?

05:25:49.960 --> 05:25:57.430
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Honorable Judge, dun po sa bank certificate po na may pumasok na remittance.

05:25:58.400 --> 05:26:06.380
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Bank certificate na pumasok sa remittance. But that's not my question. My question is Paano nalaman physically meron talagang ine-export na produkto ang Kale 88?

05:26:06.980 --> 05:26:09.020
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Wala po kaming monitoring na ganun po.

05:26:09.020 --> 05:26:09.140
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala

05:26:09.140 --> 05:26:09.840
Dr. Ceferino S. Rodolfo: po.

05:26:09.940 --> 05:26:10.300
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Why?

05:26:12.400 --> 05:26:22.320
